<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">JHN- Luyana Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="toc1">Eliywi no kuwaba okukumanena ni Jowani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jowani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jwn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Eliywi Okukumanena ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOWANI</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Eliywi okukumanena ni Jowani niinjili no tibuka tinee tili mu Tesitamente no ubya eti titalusa omooyo wa Jesu Kilesite. Einjili niinjili kame iisaniwa nji, “Eliywi” Okutalusa nji, “Eliywi no kuwaba.” Kame tina kun̄oliwa munyima no lifu lya Jesu kwa Mateu, Maleka Luka ni Jowani. Eliywi okukumanena kwa Jowani kame lina kun̄oliwa luli kwa Mutumiwa Jowani mu myaka no kukwana makumi atanu naanee munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Simba nji ebuka kayaamba nji Jowani yona kwin̄ola. Omukwa no mun̄olelo kame okufekile luli ni man̄olo a Jowani no weli neli no wiili mane neli no waatu. An̄oli anjili kame ana beeke Jowani oyoya mu mulenen̄i no Efese ba nako ino cwale kame kumonahala nji ebuka kame ina kun̄olelwa mu Efese.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jowani na kumonisa aba no kukena nji etuso no buka ni kutusa aanu okupumena nji Jesu ya Kilesite, Omwana Nyambe no kuyoya (20.31). Mukupumena eyi mwendi mbatwikala ni mooyo mu litina lyaye. Ebuka kame ina kun̄olelwa aanu onje Amajuda nawo kasa Majuda. Eliywi okukumanena ni Jowani kalikufekile ni maywi anjili aatu. Yonyene kame atwala onene omuhupulo waye ku timakazo eto ana kutenda Jesu mi kasi kun̄ola onene ku tinguli ta Jesu. Einu injili no utokwa kanyi ekolobezo ya Jesu mane omuliko na mu lihalaupa yonyene kaya sikun̄oliwa mu liywi lyaye.</para>
  <para style="iot">EMITWI NO TITABA</para>
  <para style="io1">Jowani kame atateka eliywi mu kauhanyo (1.1-18).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale kame an̄ola eino kupula no timakazo eto ana kutenda Jesu (1.19-12.50).</para>
  <para style="io1">Esisitatamako kame atoloka etinako no kupula mu mooyo wa Jesu owo utwala mane konji ku lifu lyaye ni kukwinguka kwaye (13.1-20.31).</para>
  <para style="io1">Jowani kame amana eliywi mu kauhanyo eyi no 21 okwamba einjili no tinako eyo ana kumonahala Jesu kwaanu munyima no kwinguka kwaafu, mi cwale niku monisa elibaka lyaye elyo ana kun̄olela ebuka.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Eliywi sebeli litenda Omunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Ku simuluho kame kuna kwikala Eliywi, mi Eliywi kame lina kwikala ni Nyambe, mi Eliywi neeli Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Kame ana kwikala ku simuluho ni Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Einu yonje kame ina tendiwa mwa yonyene, mi kweyi ina tendiwa kakwisa esinu no kwaa tendiwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Mwa yonyene kame kuna kwikala omooyo, mi omooyo neli eliseli no aanu onje. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Eliseli kame libenya mu uwi, mi ouwi kawasikoma eliseli.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Kame kuna kwikala omunu ona ku tumiwa okutunda kwa Nyambe, mi elitina lyaye neli Jowani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Kame ana kwiyela oupaki, mukupaka eyi no liseli, nji mwa yonyene aanu onje apumene. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Kasa nji yokame eliseli kono kame ana kwiiya mu kupaka eino liseli. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Neli eliseli no niti elyo limonyekela omunu yonje woyo oiya mu litunga.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Na kwikala mu litunga, mi elitunga kame lina tendiwa mwa yonyene, mi elitunga kalisi ku mulimuka kale. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Kame ana kwiiya ku naha yaye, mi aanu aye kasi kumu tambula. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Kono kwa onyene onje ana kumu tambula, awo ana kupumena mu litina lyaye, kame anaabi amaata no kutenda aana a Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Awo na kwa leiwa ku unyinga, simba etakazo no unu, simba oku singa kwa munu, kono oku singa kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Cwale Eliywi sebeli litendiwa omunu ni kuyaka mwaaci, yo iyalile esishemo ni niti, mi kame tuna kubuha ekanya yaye, eili ekanya eyi ilukela Omwana no libanda woyo otunda kwa Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Jowani kame ana ku paka eyaye niku kuweleza nji, “Yokame woyo nina kwamba nji, ‘Woyo oniiya munyima kame anibita, kakuli kame ana kwikalako oweli kwa mene.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Cwale mu kwiyala kwaye kame tuna wana tonje, esishemo esi siekeza ba sishemo. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Kakuli omulawo na ukwiiya mu libaka lya Mushe, esishemo ni niti kame ineeyi mu libaka lya Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Kakwisa omunu onaku monabo Nyambe. Konji Omwana feela, woyo oli ba saali sa Sitaye, yo kame woyo ona mutende nji alimukiwe.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elin̄usa lya Jowani Omukolobezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Cwale uno oupaki wa Jowani, aendisi no Majuda aba ana kutuma apulisita ni Malebi okutunda ku Jelusalema okwiiya muku mwibanguta nji, “Tiwe anyine?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Jowani sebeli opumena, kasikukana, kono sebeli wamba nji, “Kasa mene Kilesite.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Cwale sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Iikene cwale?” “Tiwe Eliya?” Jowani sebeli wamba nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Kokuulwa kasa mene,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Tiwe omunuhi wa Nyambe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Mi sebeli otambula nji, “Kokuulwa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Tiwe anyine, nji tu limuke omo sa tu tambwele awo anatu tumu. Ikene cwale wamba mulibaka lyowe?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Jowani sebeli otambula nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Time eliywi eli likuweleza mu lihalaupa, eli lyamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Mu lukise endila ya MBUMU, kanyi omo anambele omunuhi wa Nyambe Isaya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Cwale awo ana kutumiwa kame ana kutunda kwa Afalisi, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>cwale sebeli aibanguta Jowani nji, “Cwale iikene aba okolobeza nji kasa wene Kilesite, simba Eliya, simba omunuhi wa Nyambe?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Jowani sebeli waatambula nji, “Mene kame ni kolobeza ni meyi, kono omo mwaanyi kame kwimanine omunu mwaayii. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Simba yonyene woyo oiiya munyima yange, ka nitwese oku nungutula etikwele no etinjangwa taye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Eyo yonje kame ina ku tendahala mu Betani mu linjaliya lya Jodani, omo ana kwikala Jowani yo kolobeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Omukoko wa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Eliywaa lina ku tatamako Jowani sebeli omona Jesu yoiya kwa yonyene, mi sebeli wamba nji, “Komumone, uno omukoko wa Nyambe woyo utundisa esibi no litunga! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Woyo yokame nina kwamba nji, ‘Woyo oniiya munyima kame anibita, kakuli kame ana kwikalako oweli kwa mene.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Ni mene kanisi kumu limuka, kono aba ni neeyi mu ku kolobeza ni meyi, neeli nji amonahale kwa Isilaele.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Mi Jowani sebeli omupaka nji, “Kame nina mono Emebo ina tundu ku wilu ikufekile kanyi elikwici mane sebeli liikala ba yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Mene kani sikumu limuka, kono woyo onani tumu muku kolobeza ni meyi kame ana nambele nji, ‘Woyo so mone Emebo ishetumuka kwa yonyene niku mwikala beulu, yokame woyo so kolobeza ni Mebo No Kukena.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Cwale kame nina mono, mi kameni paka nji yokame Omwana a Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aiyetwa a Jesu no Weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Eliywaa lina kutatamako kame Jowani sebeli oimana na iyetwa aye ayiili, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>mi aba anaku mona Jesu yoenda sebeli wamba nji, “Komumone omukoko wa Nyambe!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Aiyetwa ayiili sebeli amuyupa yoamba eyi mane sebeli akon̄a Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Jesu aba ano kutemuna, cwale sebeli waamona amukon̄a, mi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Iikene mu saela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Labbi” (okutalusa nji Mwiyeti,) “Kubine wikala?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mwiiye mumone.” Sebeli aiya niku mona oko ana kwikalanga, mi sebeli aikala naye eliywaa elyo, kakuli neli enako no likumi ni tutanu ni kamweya (4 okuloko) no mangolwaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Adiliyasi minaye Simoni Pitolosi, neli omunjili kwa iyetwa ayiili woyo ona kuyupa Jowani yo amba, mi sebeli amukon̄a. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Kame ana kutateka oweli okuwana Simoni omukulwaye ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kame tuna wana Mesiya” (okutalusa nji “Kilesite”.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Adiliyasi sebeli olita mukulwaye kwa Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jesu sebeli omwaliketa ni kwamba nji, “Tiwe Simoni omwana a Jowani, kame soisanwe nji Kefasi.” (Okutalusa nji, “Pitolosi.”)<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Isana Filipi ni Natanaele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Eliywaa lina kutatamako Jesu sebeli osinganyeka okuta ku Galileya. Cwale sebeli owana Filipi ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Onikon̄e!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Cwale Filipi kame ana ku tunda ku Betisaida, omulenen̄i wa Adiliyasi ni Pitolosi. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filipi sebeli owana Natanaele ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Natumu wana woyo ona n̄oliwa eyaye kwa Mushe mu mulawo mane ngeseo ana kun̄ola anuhi. Jesu no Nazaleta, omwana a Josefa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanaele sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Kwa sili esinjili no kuwaba esisa si tunde ku Nazaleta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipi sebeli wamba nji, “Wiiye, omone.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Jesu sebeli omona Natanaele yoiya kwa yonyene, sebeli wamba eyaye nji, “Komumone omwisilaele no niti, mi mwa yonyene kakwisa esi sinyazahala!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanaele sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Ngasibine omo onani limukele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Filipi yokasi kwisana kale, me oikalile munji no sitondo no mukuyu kame nina kumono.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanaele sebeli omutambula nji, “Labbi, tiwe Mwana Nyambe! Ombumu no Isilaele!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Jesu sebeli otambula Natanaele nji, “Kakuli kame nina kwambele nji kame nina kumono oikalile munji no sitondo no mukuyu, bokame aba opumena? Mbumono einu no kuneneba okubita eyi!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Niti luli kame nikwambela nji mbumono eliwilu eliyatulukile, mi amangeloi a Nyambe akambama mane niku shetumukela beulu ya Mwana no Munu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Omukiti no Likwala mu Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Ba liywaa no waatu, sebeli ku tendiwa omukiti no likwala mu Kana na mu Galileya. Mi inawaye Jesu kwana kwikala, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Jesu ni yonyene sebeli oisaniwako ku likwala na iyetwa aye. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Cwale ewaine aba ina kubwa, inawaye Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ewaine naibu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula inawaye nji, “Inawange, etaba yange ni wene ibine? Enako yange kai sikeela kale.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Inawaye Jesu sebeli wambela abika nji, “Mutende eso asa myambele sonje.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikala otucoo no mawee tuna kukwana tutanu ni kamweya (6) tu suminwe abo, otu tuyowelelwa mu mukwa no Majuda, akanjili ni kanjili kame kana ku shimba owima ukuma ba mwanda. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Mwitelemo ameyi twiiyale.” Mi sebeli atwiyata mane niku yubooka. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Cwale mu tekulemo mi mu twalele osi kutaba eilya no mukiti.” Mi sebeli amu twalela. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Cwale omutabi no ilya no mukiti aba ana kwetekako ku meyi ana ku futulwa ewaine, kakuli kasi kulimuka omo ina ku tunda, (kame kuna ku limukiwa feela abika ana ku tekula ameyi), omwendisi no mukiti sebeli oisana omukwati <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Omunu yonje kame abaanga ewaine no ku mamata oweli, mi cwale aanu aba mana okukoliwa onene, cwale okubinda aabe eyi no kwamuba, kono wene kame ona teula eyi no kuwaba konji abano!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yo kame emakazo no weli eyi ana kutenda Jesu mu Kana no Galileya, mi sebeli omonisa ekanya yaye, na iyetwa aye sebeli apumena mwa yonyene.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Aba kuna kubwa eyo, Jesu sebeli oshetumuka ku Kapenauma, ni Inawaye na inaaye, na iyetwa aye, mi omo sebeli aikalamo amaywaa no kucaniba feela.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoota ku Ndoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mateu21.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maleka11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Epaseka no Majuda aba ina kukeela abeebi, cwale Jesu sebeli okambamena ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Ba patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe sebeli oka wanabo asi ku ulisa etingombe ni mikoko ni tunkwilimba, naasi kucinca amali aikalile ba myuulo yoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli okutendela olunupa no mihala icana, mi onje sebeli waacitela ku ndee no patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe, bamweya ni mikoko ni tingombe, ni kwitela banji amali no asikucinca mane ni ku kwisa etitafule too. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Cwale sebeli wambela asi kuulisa otunkwilimba nji, “Mu tundise einu eyi yonje! Kamufanene okutenda endoo ya Sitange okwifutula endoo no kuuliseta!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Aiyetwa aye sebeli apuluka cwale esi sina kun̄oliwa nji, “Kame ni liwa mu kutukufalelwa endoo ya sitange.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Cwale aendisi no Majuda sebeli aibanguta Jesu nji, “Ibine emakazo otu monisa nji kame oli ni maata no kutenda eyi no ngeesi?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mu yakulule Endoo eyi, mi mene mba ni ingula mu maywaa aatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Aendisi no Majuda sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kame ina kwana emyaka makumi anee ni mutanu ni kamweya (46) ba kuyaka Endoo ya Nyambe eyi, cwale wene mbwiiyaka mu maywaa aatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Kono kame ana kwamba Endoo ya Nyambe no lutu lwaye.<verse eid="JHN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Abo cwalehe aba ana kumana okwiingulwa kwaafu, aiyetwa aye sebeli apuluka nji kame ana kwaambela eyo, mi sebeli apumena elin̄olo ni liywi elyo ana kwamba Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu kame Alimukile omo Aikalele Aanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Cwale yooli mu Jelusalema ku mukiti no Paseka, aanu no kupula sebeli apumena mu litina lyaye aba ana kumona etimakazo ana kutenda. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Kono Jesu kaasi kwasepa, <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>kakuli kame ana kulimuka aanu onje, mi kasi kusinga oupaki no munu kakuli kame ana ku limuka esi sili mu munu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Nekudemasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga omulume no Mufalisi no litina lya Nekudemasi, omwendisi no Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Woyo mulume sebeli oiya kwa Jesu ousiku ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Labbi, kame tuyii nji yawene omwiyeti woyo otunda kwa Nyambe, kakuli kakwisa omunu otwesa okutenda etimakazo eti otenda, konji Nyambe aba ali ni yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Jesu sebeli omu tambula nji, “Niti luli kame ni kwambela nji, omunu nji kaleiwa oubya, katwese okumona omubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nekudemasi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Ngasibine saleiwe omunu yowa kulubala kale? Ninji kame saukele kame mu lipumo lya Inawaye aka leiwe aka no wiili kame?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Niti luli kame ni kwaambela nji, konji omunu aba saleiwe ni meyi ni Mebo, ka twese okwingena mu mubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Esi sina leiwa ku unu sa unu, mi esi sina leiwa ku Mebo sa Mebo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Olese okukomoka aba ni kwambela nji kame ofanene okuleyiwa oubya. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Emebo kame ifukela omo isinga, mi kame oyupa omulumo wayo, kono kuyii oko itunda noko ita. Yo ngeeso ni ku munu yonje woyo oleilwe ku Mebo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nekudemasi sebeli oibanguta Jesu nji, “Ngasibine sa itendahale eyo?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Wene kame otendile omwiyeti no Isilaele, mi cwale eyi kawiyupisisa? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Niti luli kame ni kwambela nji kame twamba eyi tu limukile, mi kame tupaka esi tuna mono, kono kutambula oupaki wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Aba nina kwambele eyi no litunga kausi pumena, ngasibine so pumene nji ni kwambela einu na kuwilu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Kakwisa omunu woyo ona kambamene ku liwilu, konji woyo ona shetumuka okutunda ku liwilu, yonyene Omwana no munu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Cwale kanyi Mushe omo ana ku tulekela enyoka mu lihalaupa, Omwana no munu ni yonyene kame afanena okutulekiwa ngeeso, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>nji cwale omunu yonje woyo opumena mwa yonyene aikale ni mooyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Kakuli Nyambe kame ana singi onene elitunga, mane kame ana libi Mwanaye no libanda, nji omunu yonje woyo opumena mwa yonyene alese okufa kono aikale ni mooyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Kakuli Nyambe kasiku tuma Mwanaye mu litunga nji atule elitunga, kono neli nji elitunga liyoyisiwe mwa yonyene.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Woyo opumena mwa yonyene ka atuliwa, kono woyo nokwa pumena na atuliwa kale, kakuli kasi pumena mu litina lya Mwanaye Nyambe no libanda. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Cwale ino ekatulo, eliseli kame lineeyi mu litunga, kono aanu kame ana singi ouwi okubita eliseli kakuli emisebezi yoo niya kwiiba. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Kakuli omunu yonge woyo otenda esi no kwiiba kame atimbile eliseli mi kaiyi ku liseli nji emisebezi yaye ilese oku nyaziwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Kono woyo otenda eyi no niti kame aiya ku liseli, nji ku monahale emisebezi yaye nji kame itundelela mwa Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Jowani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Aba kuna kubwa eyo, Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli ata mu naha no Judeya. Omo sebeli oikala noo ni kwa kolobeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Jowani ni yonyene kame ana ku kolobeza mu Enoni, abeebi ni Salimi, kakuli ameyi kame ana kupula mo. Cwale aanu kame ana kwiyanga mane nikwakolobeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Kakuli abo Jowani yokasi bekiwa kale mu tolongo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya etin̄ananyi mukaci no aiyetwa a Jowani ni Mujuda omunjili ba taba no kukenisiwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Cwale sebeli aiya kwa Jowani ni kwamba nji, “Mwiyeti, omunu ona kwikala naye mu linjaliya no Jodani, yonyene uya ona kupaka, uno yokame kame akolobeza, mi aanu kame ata kwa yonyene!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Jowani sebeli otambula nji, “Omunu ka twese oku tambula esinu, konji esi ana biwi ku wilu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Anyi mwenyene kame muli apaki ange, kame ninaamba nji, ‘Kasa mene Kilesite, kono kame nina tumiwa balubala lwaye.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Woyo oli ni mukwaliwa yo mukwati, kono omulikani no mukwati, woyo oimanine ni kuyupa, kame awabelelwa onene aba ayupa eliywi no mukwati, cwalehe oku wabelelwa kwange naku petahala. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Yonyene kame afanene okweekeza, mene ni tundise.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woyo Wiiya okutunda ku Wilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Woyo wiiya okutunda ku wilu kame ali beulu no akwaye onje. Woyo otunda mu litunga ni wa litunga, mi kame aamba kanyi woyo no litunga, woyo otunda ku wilu yonyene kame ali beulu no akwaye onje. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Woyo opaka eso ana mono neso ana yupu, kono kamu pumene oupaki waye. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Woyo ona pumene oupaki waye kame ana ongota nji Nyambe niwa niti. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Kakuli woyo ona tumiwa kwa Nyambe kame aamba amaywi a Nyambe, kakuli Nyambe ka mubi Emebo no kwetekela. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Sitange kame asinga Omwana, mi kame ana beeke einu yonje mu makaa aye. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Woyo opumena mwa Mwana kame ali ni mooyo no kwaabwa, mi woyo no kwakuteka Omwana katamba okumona omooyo, kono okutweba kwa Nyambe kame kuli beulu yaye.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Mukati no Musamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kulimuka nji Afalisi kame ana kuyupa nji na kuwana ni ku kolobeza aiyetwa no kupula okubita Jowani, <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>simba nji kasa Jesu ona ku kolobeza, kono neli aiyetwa aye, <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>cwale sebeli otunda mu Judeya ni ku ukela kame ku Galileya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Cwale kame ana kubita endila eyi no Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Cwale sebeli okeela mu mulenen̄i no Samaliya wisaniwa nji Sikale, ou uli abeebi ni litema lya Jakobo, elyo ana kuba Josefa mwanaye. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Ba kwikalile elisima lya Jakobo, mi cwale Jesu ona ku katala mu mweendo waye, sebeli oikala banji ku nyonga no lisima. Kame ina ku singa okukwana enako no hola no utanu ni kamweya (6) akamwii luli.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya omukati no Musamaliya mu kutekula ameyi, mi Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Onibe ku meyi ni nwee.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Kakuli aiyetwa aye kame ana kuta mu mulenen̄i mu kuula eilya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Omukati no Musamaliya sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Wene Omujuda, kame oni kumbela ameyi mene me nili omukati no Musamaliya?” (Kakuli Amajuda kasamo mu ukuwana ni Masamaliya.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Jesu sebeli otambula omukati nji, “Kambe kame ona limuka empo ya Nyambe ni woyo wamba kwa wene nji, ‘Onibe ku meyi ni nwee,’ kambe kame ona mukumbele, mi kame sa kube ameyi no mooyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Omukati sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mbumu, ku kwite esitekuliso, mi elisima kame litungile. Kubine ona kuwana ameyi no mooyo? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Ninji kame oli no kuneneba okubita sitetu Jakobo woyo ona kutuba elisima eli, mane kame anwa mo, yonyene na naaye ni tingombe taye?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Jesu sebeli otambula omukati nji, “Woyo onwamo yonje mu meyi aa, kame safe elilyotwa kame, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>kono woyo onwa ku meyi awo sani mube, katamba okufa elilyotwa, mi ameyi sani mube kame sa futuke mwa yonyene eliweluwelu no meyi no kububa okutwala ku mooyo no kwaabwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Omukati sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mbumu, onibe ku meyi awo, nji nilese okufa elilyotwa simba okwiiya kuno muku tekula ameyi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Jesu sebeli wambela omukati nji, “Ote, okaisane mbumowe, mi uuke kuno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Omukati sebeli otambula nji, “Mene sikwite mbumwange.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Esi wamba sokame aba wamba nji, ‘Sikwite mbumwange’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>kakuli kame ona kwikala na mbumowe atanu, mi woyo oikalile naye bano kasa mbumowe kame ona amba eniti.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Omukati sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Molyange, kame nina mono nji tiwe omunuhi wa Nyambe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>“Asitetu kame ana ku lapelelanga ba lilundu aba, kono anyi kame mwamba nji mu Jelusalema esibaka omo afanena aanu okulapelela.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mukati oni pumene, enako ikeyile abo sitange katamba oku lapelelwa ba lilundu aba simba mu Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Anyi kame mu lapela esi mwa limukile, Aci kame tu lapela esi tu limukile, kakuli oku yoyisiwa kame kutunda ku Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Kono enako ikeyile, mane ya iya kale, abo awo alapeli no niti kame sa lapele sitange ni mebo ni mu niti kakuli okame awo asaelwa kwa Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Nyambe nimebo, mi awo amulapela kame afanena oku mu lapela ni mebo ni mu niti.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Omukati sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Kame ni limuka nji Mesiya kame aiya woyo oisanwa nji Kilesite. Aba sa keele, mba tu monisa einu yonje.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mene woyo wamba kwa wene, ya mene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Mu nako eyo aiyetwa aye sebeli akeela, mi sebeli akomoka oku muwana yo amba ni mukati, kono kakwisa simba mumweya ona ku mwambisa nji, “Siikene eso osaela?” Simba nji, “Iikene eyo onaamba naye?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Cwale omukati sebeli osiya esitekulo saye no meyi ni kuukela mu mulenen̄i, nuuka ambela aanu nji, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Mwiiye mu mone omunu woyo ona nambele eyi yonje nina tende. Mwendi yokame Kilesite?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Cwale sebeli atunda mu mulenen̄i ni kwiiya kwa Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Ababo asiiya feela, aiyetwa sebeli amu kumbela nji, “Labbi, olye esinjili!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame nili ni silya no kulya eso mwalimukile.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli akwambela omunjili ku munjili nji, “Kame kuli omunu ona mulitele esi no kulya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Esilya sange ninji ni tende eso si singwa kwa woyo ona ni tumu, mi ni manenene omusebezi waye. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Esi kame mwamba nji, ‘Ku sili ni tikweti tinee, okutwala abo sakuka yangulelwe.’ Kono kame ni myambela nji, mu none amiyo enu, mwa likete amatema, kakuli sebeli aimba ouloto nji uyanguliwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Woyo oyangula kame awana mu musebezi waye, niku ungeka embuya no mooyo no kwaabwa, nji cwale woyo osikukuna ni woyo oyangula awabelelwe bamweya. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Mo kumonahalela eniti no taba eyi yaamba nji, ‘Omunjili kame akuna, omunjili kame ayangula.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Kame nina mi tumu oka yangula eyo ka mwa si sebeza, anjili kame ana sebeze, mi na mwingene mu musebezi woo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Amasamaliya no kupula na mu mulenen̄i owo sebeli apumena mwa Jesu mulibaka no mukati woyo ona kupaka nji, “Kame ana nambele eyi nina tende yonje.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Cwale Amasamaliya aba ana kwiiya kwa yonyene, sebeli amu kumbela nji aikale noo, mi sebeli oikala noo amaywaa ayiili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Mi anjili no kupula sebeli a pumena kwa yonyene, mulibaka no liywi lyaye, <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>ni kwamba ku mukati nji, “Cwale aba tu pumena, kasa mu liywi lyowe, kakuli twenyene natu kuyupele, mi kame tu limuka nji yokame luli Omuyoyisi no litunga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Omwana no Nduna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Munyima no maywaa ayiili, Jesu sebeli oukela ku Galileya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Kakuli Jesu yonyene sebeli wamba nji, “Omunuhi wa Nyambe kakutekiwa mu naha yaye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kukeela mu Galileya, sebeli oka tambulwa wino ku Magalileya ana ku mona eyi ana kutenda yonje mu Jelusalema ku mukiti, kakuli nonyene kwana kuta ku mukiti.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oiya kame mu Kana no Galileya, omo ana ku futula ameyi okwatenda ewaine. Cwale mu Kapenauma kame kuna kwikala onduna omunjili no molyaye woyo mwanaye neli omweeti. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Aba ana kuyupa nji Jesu neeyi mu Galileya okutunda ku Judeya, sebeli oiya kwa yonyene, ni ku mukumbela nji ashetumuke muku balisa mwanaye no mulume, kakuli kame ana kwikala abeebi ni kufa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Jesu cwale sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Konji aba sa mumone etiponiso ni timakazo okubinda samu pumene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Onduna sebeli omu tambula nji, “Mbumu, oshetumuke mwanange yo kasifa kale.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ote, mwanowe kame ayoya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Omulume woyo sebeli opumena eliywi lya Jesu nuukutela. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Yosi shetumuka ngeeso, abika aye sebeli amu waniketa ni ku mwambela nji, “Mwanowe kame ayoya!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Cwale sebeli waibanguta enako ana ku tangisa omwana okwikala wino, mi sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Bingolwa ba nako no utanu ni twiili akamwii (13 okuloko) elitomapa sebeli limu lesela.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Cwale sitaye sebeli olimuka nji yokame enako ana kwamba Jesu nji, “Mwanowe kame ayoya.” Mi sebeli opumena yonyene na sindoo yaye onje.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Eyo neli emakazo no wiili ana kutenda Jesu aba ana kwiiya mu Galileya, okutunda ku Judeya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Oku Balisa mu Kasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Aba kuna kubwa eyo, sebeli ku tendahala omukiti no Majuda mi Jesu sebeli okambamena ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Cwale mu Jelusalema abeebi ni Mwelo no Mikoko, kame kuli akasa kaisanwa nji Betizata mu Sihebelu, no myelo itanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Mu myelo eyo kame kuna kulangana aeti no kupula, eibofu, eihole no makondo, nasi lun̄an̄ali. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>[Kakuli abanjili elingeloi kame lina ku shetumukelanga mu kasa, mi kame lina kushelaulanga ameyi. Cwale omunu no weli woyo oingena mu meyi aba amana okushelauliwa, kame ana ku tuseha, simba otoma oweti ubine nji ubine.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Omulume mumweya kame ana kwikalanga omo, ona kutoma oweti emyaka makumi aatu ni mutanu ni twaatu (38). <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumumona ni kulimuka nji kame ana kulanganamo enako no kuleba, sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Kame osinga oku balisiwa?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Omweeti sebeli omu tambula nji, “Mbumu, sikwite omunu no ku ni beeka mu kasa ameyi aba amana okushelauka, aba nisinga nji niingenemo omukwange wa nisiya kale oku shetumukamo oweli.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Imana, oshimbe oulangano wowe, mi weende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Ababo omulume sebeli obala, ni ku shimba oulangano waye, mi sebeli weenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Cwale eliywaa elyo neli elino Pumulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Cwale aendisi no Majuda sebeli ambela woyo mulume ona ku balisiwa nji, “Lino ni lya Pumulo, ka kupumenenwe nji oshimbe oulangano wowe.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Kono sebeli waatambula nji, “Omunu woyo onani balisa na nambele nji, ‘Oshimbe oulangano wowe mi weende.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Cwale sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Anyine omunu woyo ona kwambele nji oshimbe oulangano wowe mi weende?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Kono omunu woyo ona ku balisiwa kasi kulimuka nji anyine, kakuli Jesu kame ana kwikiseta mu kupula no aanu ana kwikala omo mu sibaka.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Kutunda abo, Jesu sebeli omu wana mu Ndoo ya Nyambe ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Omone, nu bala kono olese okutenda esibi kame, mwendi esi sicilisa oku bitelela mba si kwiyele.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Omulume woyo sebeli ota nu kambela aendisi no Majuda nji neli Jesu ona mubalisa. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Cwale esi sokame eso aendisi no Majuda ana kuyandiseta Jesu, kakuli na kutenda eyo eli no Pumulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Kono Jesu sebeli waatambuta nji, “Sitange kame asebeza enako yonje, mi ni mene kame ni sebeza.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Elibaka elyo aendisi no Majuda ana kusinga oku mwibaela okubita ba weli, kakuli kasi kumatuka feela omulawo no Pumulo, kono kame yonyene ni kwisana Nyambe nji Sitaye mane nuukubeeka ba siyemo simweya ni Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaata no Mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Niti luli kameni myambela nji, Omwana katwese okutenda esinu yonyene, konji ana kumona Sitaye yo sitenda. Kakuli eyo atenda yonje, ni yonyene Mwana kame aitenda ngeeso. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Kakuli Sitaye kame asinga Omwana, mane kame amu monisa eyo atenda yonje, mi mba mumonisa emisebezi no kuneneba okubita eyi nji mu komoke. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Kakuli kanyi Sitange aba aingula asikufa ni kwa yoyisa, ni Mwana yongeeso kame aaba awo asinga. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Sitange kaatula omunu, kono kame anabi Omwana etikatulo tonje, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>nji onje awo akuteke Omwana kanyi omo akutekela Sitange. Woyo no kwakuteka Omwana ka kuteke ni Sitange ona mu tumu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, woyo oyupa eliywi lyange ni ku pumena kwa woyo onani tumu, kame ali ni mooyo no kwaabwa. Ka tamba okwatuliwa, kono nabiti mu lifu okwingena mu mooyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, enako kame iiya, mane yaiya kale, abo aafu kame sa yupe eliywi lya Mwana Nyambe, mi awo aliyupa mba yoyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Kakuli kanyi Sitange aba ali ni mooyo mwa yonyene, ni Mwana ngeeso kame ana mubi okwikala ni mooyo mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Mi na mubi ni maata no kwatula, kakuli yokame Omwana no Munu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Mulese ku komoka ba taba eyo, kakuli enako kame iiya, abo aali mu mayumbelo onje mba yupu eliywi lyaye, <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>mi awo ana tende eino kuwaba aingukele omooyo, mi awo ana tende eino kwiiba aingukele ekatulo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oupaki kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Sitwese okutenda esinu mu maata ange, kanyi aba niyupa, kame na tula, mi ekatulo yange ya kuluka, kakuli sitende esisi singwa kwa mene, kono esisi singwa kwa yonyene onani tumu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Nji kame ni kupaka menyene, oupaki wange kasa wa niti. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Kwaali omunjili woyo opaka eyange, mi kame niyii nji oupaki owo ani paka nawo niwa niti. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Kame muna tumu aanu kwa Jowani, mi na paka eniti. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Kasa nji oupaki nina tambula kame onatundu ku munu, kono kame naamba feela eyo nji mu kayoyisiwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yonyene neli olumonyi lu tumbuka, ni lambi eyi imonyeka, mi anyi namu singi oku wabelelwa enako icana mu liseli lyaye. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Kono oupaki nili nawo ni wa kuneneba okubitelela wa Jowani, kakuli emisebezi ana nibi Sitange oku manenena, yokame emisebezi eyi nitenda, eini paka nji Sitange nani tumu. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Cwale Sitange ona nitumu, ni yonyene kame ana paka eyange. Eliywi lyaye ka musili yupa simba okumona omo aikalele, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>mi eliywi lyaye kali siikala mwaanyi, kakuli woyo ona tumiwa kwa yonyene kamu mupumene. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Kame musaisisa aman̄olo, kakuli kame mu yambuta nji mba mu wanamo omooyo no kwaabwa. Aman̄olo awo okame apaka eyange! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Kono kame mukana okwiiya kwa mene nji mwikale ni mooyo no kwaabwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Sitambula okububekwa oko kutunda kwaanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Kono kame ni yii nji kakwisa elilato lya Nyambe mwaanyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Mene kame nineyi mu litina lya Sitange, mi ka mu sini tambula, nji mundina aiye mu litina lyaye feela, yonyene mbamu mu tambula. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Ngasibine sa mu pumene woyo otambula emilumbeko itunda kwaanu, mi ka musaele emilumbeko itunda feela kwa Nyambe? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Mu lese oku yambuta nji kame sani mikandimeke kwa sitange, neli Mushe woyo ona kumikandimeka, ba yonyene bamuna kubeeka esepo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Nji kame mu na kupumena Mushe, ni mene mba muni pumene, kakuli yonyene na n̄olo eyange. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Kono nji kamwa sipumena eyo ana kun̄ola, ngasibine sa mu pumene amaywi ange?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Fepa Aanu no Kukwana Eikiti Itanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateu14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maleka6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Aba kunabu eyo, Jesu sebeli ota mu linjaliya no liwate no Galileya, eliwate no Tibeliyasi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Mi aanu no kupula onene sebeli amukon̄a, kakuli kame ana ku mona etimakazo eti ana kutenda kwa asikutoma. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli okambamena ba lilundu, mi abo sebeli okaikala banji na iyetwa aye. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Cwale Epaseka, omukiti no Majuda kame ona kwikala abeebi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Jesu aba ana kwaliketa cwale sebeli omona aanu no kupula onene aiya kwa yonyene, mi sebeli wambela Filipi nji, “Kubine sa tuule einkwa nji cwale aa aanu awane esi no kulya?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Eyi kame ana kuyamba ngeeso oku mweteka, kakuli yonyene kame ana ku limuka esi ana kufanena okutenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipi sebeli omutambula nji, “Emyanda yiili (200) no muwaya-waya ka yuulu einkwa no kupula nji omunjili ni munjili awane esino kucaniba feela.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Omunjili no aiyetwa aye, Andiliyasi mina Simoni Pitolosi, sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Kame kuna kwikala ondumbana omo, ona kwikala ni inkwa itanu ni tusi twiili. Kono eyo ni iikene kwaanu no kupula ngeeso?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Mwiikate aanu banji.” Abo kame kuna kwikala omoopu no kupula onene ba sibaka eso, cwale alume sebeli aikala banji, mu palo no kukwana eikiti itanu (5;000). <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba einkwa, cwale aba ana kumana ouku tumela, sebeli otabela awo ana kwikala banji, mi cwale sebeli otenda ngeeso niku tindi, cwale sebeli waaba omu ana kusingela. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwikuta, sebeli wambela aiyetwa aye nji, “Mu tole oubulumusi ona siyalabo, nji ku lese oku yumbiwabo esinjili.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Cwale sebeli autola mane ni kwiyata amatanda likumi na yiili no inkwa itanu, ou ona ku siiwa kwa sikulya.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Cwale aanu aba ana kumona emakazo ana kutenda Jesu, sebeli aamba nji, “Niti luli yokame omunuhi wa Nyambe ona kufanena okwiiya mu litunga!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Cwale Jesu aba na limuka nji kame ana ku singa oku mulema nji atendiwe ombumu, sebeli okutela kame yomboci ba lilundu.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Enda ba Meyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateu14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maleka6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Cwale aba kuna kutenda amangolwaa, aiyetwa aye sebeli ashetumuka ku liwate, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>ni kwingena mu wato, niku tangisako oku lutela mu linjaliya no liwate okuta ku Kapenauma. Neli ousiku luli, mi Jesu yoka sikeela kale kwa onyene. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Cwale sebeli kwinguka amandinda mulibaka no mebo ina kufuka onene. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Aba ana kumana okupuwa etibima taatu simba tinee, sebeli amona Jesu yo enda ba liwate, ni kusheeteta ku wato, cwale sebeli acila onene. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Kono sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Meene, mu lese kucila!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Cwale sebeli awabelelwa ni kumulonga mu wato, mi ababo owato sebeli ofuwama ba likamba abo ana kulumba.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aanu aba ana ku Saela Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Ba liywaa lina ku tatamako, aanu awo ana kusiyala mu linjaliya no liwate, sebeli alemuha nji kakwa siku siyala owato omunjili muya. Cwale Jesu kasi kwingena mu wato na iyetwa aye, kono aiyetwa aye kame ana kuta omboci. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Simbakulingeeso cwale amato anjili ana ku tunda mu Tibeliya, me akeela kale abeebi ni sibaka eso ana kulyela einkwa Ombumu aba ana kumana ouku tumela. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Cwale aanu aba ana kumona nji Jesu kasi kwikalamo, simba aiyetwa aye, onyene sebeli aingena mu maato omo ni kuta ku Kapenauma alemine oku saela Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Esinkwa no Mooyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Cwale aba ana kuwana Jesu mu linjaliya no liwate, sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Labbi, ka mwaka oneyi kuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, aba mu ni saela, kasa nji na mumono etimakazo, kono ninji na muli einkwa mane na mwikuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Mu lese oku sebeleza esilya eso sibwa, kono esilya eso simi twala ku mooyo no kwaabwa. Eso Omwana no Munu asa mibe, kakuli ba yonyene Nyambe Sitange kame ana mubeeke eliswayo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Cwale sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Iikene satu tende, nji tu tende emisebezi ya Nyambe?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Uno omusebezi wa Nyambe nji mu pumene kwa woyo ona tumiwa kwa yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kaike emakazo sotende nji tumone, mi tu pumene kwa wene? Kamwike omusebezi otenda? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Asitetu kame anali amaana mu lihalaupa, kanyi aba kun̄olilwe nji, ‘Na kwaaba esinkwa eso situnda ku wilu nji alye.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela,” “Mushe kasi kumiba esinkwa naku wilu, kono Sitange na mibi esinkwa no niti naku wilu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Kakuli esinkwa sa Nyambe sokame eso situnda ku wilu mi kame siba omooyo ku litunga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, otube esinkwa eso mu nako yonje.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Time esinkwa no mooyo,” “Woyo oiya kwa mene ka tamba okuyomba, mi woyo opumena kwa mene katamba okufa elinyotwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Kono kame nina myambele nji namu nimono kono kamu sipumena. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Sonje esi aniba sitange, kame sa siiye kwa mene. Cwale woyo oiya kwa mene sitamba oku mucitela kundee. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Kakuli kame nina shetumuka okutundu ku wilu kasa mu kutenda eso si singwa kwa mene, kono esi si singwa kwa woyo ona ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Mi sokame eso si singwa kwa woyo ona ni tumu, nji ni lese oku taukelwa ku sinjili kweeyo ana nibi yonje, kono ni iingule mu liywaa no mamaneneno. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Kakuli sokame eso si singwa kwa Sitange nji omunu yonje woyo omona Omwana ni ku pumena mwa yonyene aikale ni mooyo no kwaabwa. Mi mba ni mwingula ba liywaa no mamaneneno.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Amajuda sebeli an̄un̄uta mulibaka lyaye, kakuli kame ana kwamba nji, “Time esinkwa esi situnda ku wilu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Cwale sebeli aamba nji, “Kasa yokame Jesu, omwana Josefa, woyo sitaye ni inawaye tu yii? Ngaibi aamba nji, kame ni tunda ku wilu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mu lese okun̄un̄uta mukaci kenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Kakwisa omunu soiya kwa mene konji aba sakokiwe kwa sitange ona ni tumu, mi mene mba ni mwingula ba liywaa no mamaneneno. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Kame ina n̄oliwa mwa nuhi a Nyambe nji, ‘Omunu yonje mba iyetiwa kwa Nyambe.’ Cwale omunu yonje woyo ona yupu mane ni kwiyetiwa kwa Sitange kame aiya kwa mene. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Kasa nji kame kuli omunu ona mono Sitange, konji yonyene woyo ona tundu kwa Nyambe yonyene ona mono Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, woyo opumena kwa mene kame ali ni mooyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Time esinkwa no mooyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Asitenu naali amaana mu lihalaupa, mi naafu. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Kono sino esinkwa esi situnda ku wilu, nji omunu olyako alese okufa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Time esinkwa no kuyoya, esi sina tundu ku wilu. Omunu nji alye esinkwa eso, kame sa yoye enako yonje. Mi esinkwa sa nibe oku yoyisa elitunga, enyama yange.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Cwale Amajuda sebeli aku kananisa mukaci koo nji, “Omunu uyu ngaibi sa tube enyama yaye nji twiilye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela konji aba sa mulye enyama no Mwana no Munu ni kunwa ounyinga waye, omooyo kausako mwaanyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Woyo yonje solya enyama yange ni kunwa ku unyinga wange, kame sa ikale ni mooyo no kwaabwa mane mbani mwingula ba liywaa no mamaneneno. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Kakuli enyama yange, silya luli ni unyinga wange wa kunwa luli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Woyo olya ku nyama yange ni kunwa ku unyinga wange kame ali mwa mene, ni mene mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Kanyi Sitange no kuyoya aba anani tumu, mane niku yoya mulibaka lya sitange, cwale woyo onilya kame sa yoye mulibaka lyange. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Esi sokame esinkwa sina tundu ku wilu, ka siku feke neso anali asitenu ni kufa. Woyo olya ku sinkwa esi mba yoyo enako yonje.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Jesu kame ana kwamba etaba eyo mu ndoo no milapelo kanyi omo ana kwiyetela mu Kapenauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaywi no Mooyo no Kwaabwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Anjili no kupula kwa iyetwa aye, aba ana kuyupa eyo sebeli aamba nji, “Omwambelo uno niwa kubambaba. Anyine so uteeteta?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Kono Jesu naku limuka mu mucima waye nji aiyetwa aye kame an̄un̄uta ba taba eyo, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ninji etaba eyo kame imi sitatalisa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Cwale ngasibine saku tendahale abasa mumone Omwana no munu yo kambamena oko ana kwikala oweli? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Emebo yokame eyi iba omooyo, enyama ka itusu esinjili. Amaywi nina myambele okame mebo ni moyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Kono muno mwaanyi kwaali anjili no kwa pumena.” Kakuli Jesu kame ana kulimuka ku matangiseto awo saulwe oku pumena, ni woyo somu beteka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Cwale sebeli wekeza okwamba nji, “Lyo kame elibaka nina myambele nji kakwisa woyo soiya kwa mene konji woyo ona biwi ngeeso kwa Sitange.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Okutunda abo, ano kupula kwa iyetwa aye sebeli aukela munyima okulesa oku mukon̄a okweenda naye. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwawo ana kukwana likumi na yiili nji, “Naanyi kame musinga oukutela ngeeso?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoni Pitolosi sebeli omu tambula nji, “Mbumu, kame sa tute kwa nyine? Kame oli ni maywi no mooyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Cwale aci natu pumene ni kulimuka nji ya wene no Kukena wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kasa mene nina mikete moonje ano kukwana likumi na yiili? Cwale omunjili kwaanyi ni mudimona!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Kame ana kwamba Judasi Omwana Simoni Isikalioti, kakuli yokame omunjili no asikukwana likumi na yiili (12) yoso mu beteka.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu na Inaaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Aba ku nabwi eyo, Jesu sebeli ota yo iyeta aanu mu Galileya, kasi kusinga okuta mu Judeya, kakuli aendisi no Majuda kame ana kusinga oku mwibaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Cwale omukiti no Majuda ona kwisaniwa nji Tabanakele (eikun̄wa) kame ana kwikala abeebi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>cwale ainaye Jesu sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Otunde muno mi ote ku Judeya, nji aiyetwa owe amone emisebezi eyi otenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Kakuli kakwisa omunu osebeleza ku mukunda nji kame asinga okulimukiwa wino. Nji kame otenda einu eyi, oku monahaze wenyene ku litunga!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Kakuli simba onyene ainaye kasi kupumena mwa yonyene.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Enako yange ka isikeela kale, kono enako yenu kame iliko enako yonje. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Elitunga kali twese oku mitimba, kono kame litimbile mene, kakuli kame nipaka emisebezi ya lyo nji niya kwiiba. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Anyi mute ku mukiti. Mene ka niti ku mukiti owo, kakuli enako yange ka isi petahala kale.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Aba ana ku mana okwamba eyo, sebeli osiyala mu Galileya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoli ku Mukiti no Ikun̄wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Kono munyima no ainaye okuta ku mukiti, cwale ni yonyene sebeli otako, kasa mu uku monahaza, kono mu kwa limukiwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Cwale aendisi no Majuda ba mukiti sebeli a musaela, ni kwibanguta nji, “Ku bine ali?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Mi oko kame kuna kwikala onene eyi no kumooba. Anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Jesu niwa kuluka,” Anjii nji, “Kokuulwa, kame ayaukisa aanu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Mulibaka no kucila aendisi no Majuda kakwisa omunu ona kwamba eyaye mu kulukuluha.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Bakaci no Mukiti Jesu sebeli okambamena ku Ndoo ya Nyambe nuuka iyetamo. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Aendisi no Majuda sebeli a komoka ni kwamba nji, “Ngasibine aikalile uyu munu aba alimukile, mi ka siku kwiiyeta?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Etuto yange ka itundu kwa mene, kono kame itunda kwa woyo onani tumu. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Nji omunu omunjili kame asinga okutenda esisi singwa kwa Nyambe kame sa limuke etuto yange nji kame itunda kwa Nyambe, nji kame ni kwambela feela menyene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Woyo okwambela mu maata aye yonyene kame asinga ekanya yaye feela. Kono woyo osinga ekanya ya woyo ona mutumu niwa niti, mi kakwisa okwiiba mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Kasa nji Mushe kasi kumiba omulawo? Kono kakwisa mwaanyi ona mamele omulawo. Iikene mu saelela okuni ibaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Aanu sebeli atambula nji, “Kame okwite edimona.” “Anyine woyo osaela oku kwibaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kame nina tende omusebezi mumweya, mi moonje kame mu na ukomoka. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Mushe na ku miba omulawo no mupato (kasa nji kame utunda kwa Mushe, kono kame utunda kwa Sitenu naku kale), mi anyi kame mu beeka omunu mu mupato eli no pumulo. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Nji cwale eli no Pumulo omunu kame abekiwa mu mupato nji omulawo wa Mushe omameliwe, iikene muni kaniseta oku balisa omunu olutu lwaye lonje ba liywaa elino pumulo?<verse eid="JHN 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Mu lese okwatula ni sobozi, kono mwatule mu kuluka.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yokame Kilesite?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Cwale anjili aanu namu Jelusalema sebeli aamba nji, “Kasa yokame uyu mulume asaela okwibaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Mi yokame uno, kame aamba patalaza, mi kakwisa esinjili esi aamba kwa yonyene! Ninji aendisi no Majuda nalimuka nji luli yokame Kilesite? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kono kame tuyii oko atunda wuyu munu, mi cwale Kilesite aba sa monahale, kakwisa woyo so limuka oko sa tunde.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kanyi omo ana kwiyetela ba patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe nji, “Kame muni limukile ni kulimuka oko ni tunda? Kono kani siku kulita menyene, woyo onani tumu niwa niti, mi yonyene mwa limukile. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Mene ni muyii, kakuli kame ni tunda kwa yonyene mi yokame onani tumu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Cwale sebeli aeteka oku mununga, kono kame kuna kuulwa omunu no ku mulema, kakuli enako yaye kaya si kukeela kale. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Cwale aanu no kupula sebeli apumena mwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Cwale Kilesite aba sa iye, kame sa tende etimakazo no kupula okubita eti anatende wuyu mulume?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atateleli Atumiwa oka Nunga Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Afalisi sebeli ayupa aanu no kupula alemine okumooba, cwale apulisita akulu na Falisi sebeli atuma amapolisa oka mununga. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Ni sili naanyi enakoicana, mi cwale kame sa nite kwa woyo onani tumu. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Mba muni saele, kono kamu tamba ku niwana, mi kamu twese okwiiya omu nili.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Cwale aendisi no Majuda sebeli akwambisa omunjili ku munjili nji, “Kubine sate wuyu munu, nji tu kwangwe oku muwana? Ninji kame sate ku Magelike, aka iyete Amagelike? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Iikene eyo atalusa aba aamba nji, mba muni saele kono ka mutamba kuni wana, mi oko nili kamutwese okwiyako?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Otusindi no Mooyo kame Tuba Ameyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Ba liywaa noku manenena omukiti, eliywaa no utokwa, Jesu sebeli oimana ni kwamba nji, “Omunu aba afile elinyotwa aiye kwa mene mi anwe, <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>mi woyo opumena mwa mene, kanyi aman̄olo omo ambela nji, ‘Okutunda mu mucima waye kame sa kubube emisindi no meyi ayoyisa.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Cwale eyi kame ana kwamba eyi no Mebo, eyo awo apumena mwa yonyene asa fanene okwitambula. Kakuli abo Emebo eka yasibiwa kale, mulibaka lya Jesu yo kasi ku yeemiwa kale.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oukutaba mukaci no Aanu mulibaka lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa amaywi awo, aanu anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Luli yokame omunuhi wa Nyambe!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Yokame Kilesite!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Kono anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Ninji Kilesite kame sa fanene okutunda mu Galileya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Kasa nji elin̄olo kame lyamba nji Kilesite kame sa tunde mu lusika lwa Dabida mi kame atunda mu Betelehema, omundi ana kwikala Dabida.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya oukutaba mukaci no aanu mulibaka lyaye. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Cwale anjili sebeli asinga oku mununga, kono kakwisa ona kubeeka elyooko ba yonyene.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaata no Aendisi no Majuda no kwa Pumena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Cwale amapolisa sebeli aukela kwa pulisita akulu ni kwa Afalisi, awo ana kwaibanguta nji, “Iikene aba kamwasi mulita?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Amapolisa sebeli atambula nji, “Simba kwatanga kakwisa omunu onaamba kanyi omunu wuyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Cwale Afalisi sebeli aatambula nji, “Ninji naanyi na moongiwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Kwa endisi no Majuda ni kwa Afalisi kame kuli awo ana pumene mwa yonyene? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Kono aanu no kupula aa, awo no kwa limuka omulawo, kame akutilwe!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nekudemasi ona kukutangeta okuta kwa Jesu mi yoli omunjili kwa onyene sebeli waambela nji, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Kana omulawo wetu kame otwesa okwatula omunu yo kasi yupa oweli ni kukwiyeta esi ana tende.” <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Sebeli atambula nji, “Ni wene kame otunda mu Galileya? Osingisise mi mbu mono nji kakwisa omunuhi wa Nyambe so imekwa okutunda mu Galileya.” [<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Cwale omunjili ni munjili sebeli okutela ku ndoo yaye.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Omukati ona ku Lemiwa yo Buka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ota ba lilundu no itondo no Olibe. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Amasiku luli Jesu kame sebeli oukela ku patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe. Aanu onje sebeli aiya kwa yonyene, cwale sebeli oikala banji ni kwaiyeta. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Cwale aiyeti no mulawo na Falisi sebeli alita omukati onaku waniwa yo buka ni kumubeeka mukaci koo. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Sebeli aamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mwiyeti, omukati wuyu kame ana waniwa yo buka. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Cwale mu mulawo, Mushe kame ana tu laele okwibaa ni mawee aa no ngeeso. Wene ngasibine wamba mulibaka lyaye?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Esi kame ana kwamba ngeeso oku mweteka, nji atwese oku mukandimeka. Kono Jesu sebeli oinamena banji yo n̄ola ni munwe waye. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Cwale alemine okwekeza oku mwibanguta, Jesu sebeli oinumuka ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Nji omunjili mukaci kenu no kwatenda esibi atende wuyu no matatekelo okukonda eliwee ba yonyene.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Cwale sebeli oinama kame ni kun̄ola ni munwe waye banji. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Kono aba ana kuyupa eyo, sebeli akutela omunjili ni munjili oku tangiseta kwa kulu oweli. Jesu sebeli osiyala yomboci, omukati yo imanine balubala lwaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oinumuka ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mukati kubine ali aanu? Kakwisa wuyu ona kubi omubonda?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Omukati sebeli otambula nji, “Kakwisa omunu, Mbumu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ni mene sikubi omubonda. Ote, mi olese okutenda esibi kame.”]<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Eliseli no Litunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Jesu kame sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Time eliseli no litunga,” “Woyo oni kon̄a katamba okwenda mu uwi, kono kame sa ikale ni liseli no mooyo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Cwale Afalisi sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kame okupaka wenyene, oupaki wowe kasa wa niti.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Naba niku paka menyene, oupaki wange ni wa niti kakuli kame ni limuka omu ni tunda, nomu nita. Kono anyi ka mulimukile omuni tunda nomu nita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Anyi kame mwatula ni unu, mene kani atula omunu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Cwale naaba sani atule, ekatulo yange niya niti, kakuli kasa mene memboci natula, kono kame natula ni sitange ona ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Mu mulawo wenu kame kun̄olilwe nji oupaki no aanu ayiili niwa niti. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Time niku paka menyene, mi sitange ona ni tumu kame ani paka ni yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Okwali Sitowe?” Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kamu niyii, simba Sitange kamu muyii,” “Nji kambe namu kuni limuka, kambe ni sitange namu mulimuka ngeeso.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Jesu kame ana kwamba amaywi aa yo iyeta ba patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe abeebi ni ibaka omo kutewelwangwa enubu. Kono kakwisa omunu ona ku mununga, kakuli enako yaye kaya sikukeela kale.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kamutwese Okuta Oko Nikatile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Jesu sebeli waambela kame nji, “Kame ni kutela, mi mba muni saele, mi mbamufele mu sibi senu. Oko nita, kamu twese okwiyako.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Aendisi no Majuda sebeli akwibanguta nji, “Ninji kame sa kwibae yonyene kakuli kame aamba nji oko nita kamu twese okwiyako?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Anyi kame mu tunda banji, mene kame ni tunda ku wilu. Anyi kame muli asi litunga lino mene kasa nili wa litunga lino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Kame nina myambele nji kame sa mufele mu ibi yenu. Kakuli anyi mba mufele mu ibi yenu konji aba samu pumene ‘esi nili so’.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Tiwe anyine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kanyi aba nina myambele okutunda ku matatekelo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Kame nili neyi no kupula eyi no kwamba mulibaka lyenu neyi no kwatula, kono woyo ona nitumu niwa niti, mi kame nambela elitunga esi nina yupu okutunda kwa yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Kame ana ku kwangwa oku yupisisa nji kame ana kwamba noo eya Sitaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Aba sa mumane oku tuleka Omwana no munu, cwale basa mulimukele esi nili so, mi ka nitende esinjili menyene, kono kame naamba esi anani iyete Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Cwale woyo ona nitumu kame ali ni mene. Yonyene kasi nisiya memboci, kakuli enako yonje kame nitenda eyi imu wabelisa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yo lemine okwamba eyo, ano kupula sebeli apumena mwa yonyene.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eniti mbaimi Lukulula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wambela Amajuda awo ana kupumena mwa yonyene nji, “Nji kame mutwalelela mu liywi lyange, mba mu tende aiyetwa ange no niti, <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>mi mba mulimuka eniti, mane eniti mbaimi lukulula.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Sebeli amu tambula nji, “Aci kame tuli asi lusika lwa Abulahama, mi katusi tendiwa kale abika ku munu. Iikene eso sikwambisa nji, ‘Mba mu lukululwa’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela nji omunu yonje woyo otenda esibi kame ali omubika ku sibi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Omubika katwalelele okwikala mu ndoo enako yonje, kono omwana kame aikalamo enako yonje. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Cwale nji Omwana kame ami lukulula, mba mu tende asi kulukululwa luli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Kame ni yii nji aanyi olusika lwa Abulahama. Cwale kame musaela oku nibaa, kakuli eliywi lyange kame lyulwile esibaka mwaanyi. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Kame namba esi nina mono kwa Sitange, mi anyi kame mu tenda esi mu nayupu kwa Sitenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Cwale sebeli amutambula nji, “Abulahama Sitetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Nji kame muli aana a Abulahama, kambe kame mu tenda emisebezi ana tende Abulahama. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Kono bano kame mu saela oku nibaa, omunu ona myambele eniti nina yupu okutunda kwa Nyambe. Esi kasokame ana kutenda Abulahama. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Anyi kame mu tenda eso ana kutenda Sitenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Aci katusiku leyelwa mu unyazi Sitetu ni mumweya, yokame Nyambe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Nji Nyambe neli Sitenu, kambe kame muni singa, kakuli kame ni simuluha ni kwiiya okutunda kwa Nyambe, kani siku kwiyela menyene, kono yokame ona ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Iikene aba kamwa yupisisa eyi ninaamba? Kakuli ka mupumene amaywi ange. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Anyi kame mu tunda kwa sitenu Satani, mi kame mu singa okutenda etitakazo ta sitenu. Neli omwibai okutunda ku matangiseto, mi kakwisa eso atenda ni niti, kakuli kakwisa eniti mwa yonyene. Aba aonga, kame aamba esi ali so luli kakuli niwa mapwa mi sitaye amapwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Kono kakuli kame ni myambela eniti, kamuni pumene. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Anyine mwaanyi woyo soni monisa nji kame nili ni sibi? Nji kame ni myambela eniti, iikene aba kamwa nipumene? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Woyo oli wa Nyambe kame amamela amaywi a Nyambe. Elibaka aba kamwa mamele ninji kamutendile aa a Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Abulahama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Amajuda sebeli atambula Jesu nji, “Katwamba wino aba twamba nji kame oli Omusamaliya mi kame okwite edimona?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Sikwite amadimona, kono kame nikuteka Sitange, mi anyi kamuni kuteke. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Cwale kani saele ekanya yange, kwaali woyo oisaela mane kame satende omwatuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji omunu kame ateula eliywi lyange, ka tamba okufa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Amajuda sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Cwale kame tu limuka nji kame uli ni madimona! Abulahama nafu kanyi omo ana tendele anuhi a Nyambe, mi wene kame wamba nji, Omunu aba ateula eliywi lyange katamba okufa. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Kana kame onenebile okubitelela sitetu Abulahama woyo onafu? Mane na nuhi a Nyambe naafu. Wene kame oku beeka anyine?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Nji kame niku kanyisa menyene, ekanya yange ka ikwite tuso. Sitange yoni kanyisa, woyo mwamba nji Nyambe wenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Kono kamwasi mulimuka mene ni muyii. Nji nambe nji kani muyii kame sani tende omoongi kanyi anyi, kono mene kame nimu limuka mane kame ni mamela eliywi lyaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Sitenu Abulahama naku wabelelwa nji amone eliywaa lyange naku limona mane naku wabelelwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Cwale Amajuda sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ka wasikwanisa kale emyaka makumi atanu, mi nu mono Abulahama?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, Abulahama yokasiikalako kale, ‘Me niliko’.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Cwale sebeli atola amawee ni kumu konda, kono Jesu sebeli okushweeka, mane ni kutunda ba patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Omulume ona Kuleiwa yo Kamono.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Jesu yobita, sebeli omona omulume ona kuleiwa yoka mono. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Cwale aiyetwa aye sebeli amwibaguta nji, “Labbi, anyine ona tende esibi kana niyonyene nji ashemi aye, aba ana leiwa yoka mono?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kasanji wuyu mulume kame ana tende esibi, simba ashemi aye. Kono ninji emisebezi ya Nyambe imonahalele mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Kame tufanena okusebeza emisebezi ya woyo ona nitumu, abo kusili omunji, ousiku aba sowiiye kakwisa omunu sotwesa okusebeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Kanyi aba nisili mu litunga, time eliseli no litunga.<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba ngeeso, sebeli osibwela banji niku kanda endowa no mate awo, mi sebeli olamba ba miyo no mulume ni ndowa <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ote oka kuyowe mu kasindi no Siloamu” (okutalusa nji kutumiwa). Cwale sebeli ota oka kuyowa ni kuukamo yo mona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Aa ayoya naye nawo ana ku mu monanga yoli omukumbeli kunyima sebeli aamba nji, “Kana wuyu kasa yokame omulume ona kwikalanga mane yo kumbelanga?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Yo kame” Anjili nji, “Kokuulwa, kono kame akufekile kanyi yokame.” Yonyene sebeli wamba nji “Ya mene luli.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Cwale ngasibine kuna kutendahala nji amiyo owe afukuke?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Sebeli otambula nji, “Omulume wisaniwa Jesu kame ana ku kanda endowa ni kunokela mu miyo ange ni kwamba kwa mene nji ote ku kasindi no Siloamu, cwale sebeli nita nukakuyowa sebeli nimona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Okwaali yonyene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Sebeli otambula nji, “Siyii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Afalisi aba ana Kusaisisisa oku Balisiwa oko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Cwale sebeli alita kwa Afalisi omulume no kwamona. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Cwale neli eliywaa no Pumulo abo Jesu ana kukanda endowa ni kuyatulula amiyo aye. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Afalisi sebeli amwibanguta kame omu ana kutendelwa nji amiyo aye amone. Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame ana kubeeka endowa ba miyo ange nukuyowa mi sebeli ni mona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Cwale Afalisi anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Wuyu mulume katundu kwa Nyambe, kakuli kamamela Epumulo.” Kono anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Ngasibine omulume woyo oli osikutenda eibi nji atende etimakazo no ngeesi?” Kame kuna kwikala oukutaba mukaci koo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Cwale kame sebeli aibanguta omulume no kwamona nji, “Iikene wamba mulibaka lyaye, okutunda abo ana kuyatulula amiyo owe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Omulume sebeli wamba nji, “Kame ali omunuhi wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Cwale aendisi no Majuda kasiku pumena nji omunu woyo kame ana ku leiwa yoli esibofu, mi nawana okumona kwaye, konji aba ana kwisana ashemi no mulume ona kutwesa okumona <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>ni kwaibanguta nji, “Wuyu mwanenu? Woyo mwamba nji kame ana kuleiwa yoli esibofu, ngasibine kuna tendahala nji bano amone?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Ashemi aye sebeli atambula nji, “Mwanetu wuyu mi kame ana kuleiwa yoka mono. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Kono omo kunaiyele nji amone katuyii simba okulimuka woyo ona yatulula amoyo aye. Mu mwibangute, nakulu kame saambe yonyene!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Ashemi aye kame ana kwamba ngeeso mu kucila aendisi no Majuda, kakuli Amajuda kame ana kupumena nji omunu aba sa pumene nji Jesu yokame Kilesite, kame sa kondelwe kundee no ndoo no milapelo. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Cwale ashemi aye sebeli amba nji, “Mukulu, mu mwibangute!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Cwale aka no wiili sebeli aisana omulume ona kuleiwa yoka mono ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Oyeeme Nyambe! Kame tuyii nji wuyu mulume ni osikutenda eibi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Yonyene sebeli otambula nji, “Simba nji ninatende esibi, siyii.” “Esinu simweya niyii ninji kame nina kutenda wuyu no kwamona, kono bano kame ni mona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Iikene ana kutenda kwa wene?” “Ngasibine ana kuyatulula amiyo owe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Sebeli waatambula nji, “Kale aba nina myambele kono ka musi teeteta. Iikene aba musinga okuyupa kame? Kame musinga okutenda aiyetwa aye?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Cwale sebeli amu nyefula ni kwamba nji, “Tiwe omwiyetwa waye kono aci kame tuli aiyetwa a Mushe. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Aci kame tuyii nji Nyambe kame ana kwamba kwa Mushe, kono kanyi ba wuyu mulume katu yii oko atunda!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Omulume sebeli waatambula nji, “Iikene esi kame sikomokisa! Kamutamba okulimuka oko atunda mi cwale nani yatulula amiyo ange! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Cwale kame tuyii nji Nyambe ka yupu asi kutenda eibi, kono nji omunu kame ali omulapeli wa Nyambe mane nikutenda eso asinga, Nyambe kame amuteeteta. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Asimba kwatanga okutunda ku matatekelo no litunga kaku siyupiwa kale omunu ona yatulula amiyo no munu ona kuleiwa yoka mono. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Nji omunu wuyu kasi kutunda kwa Nyambe, kambe kakwisa esi ana twese okutenda.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Seli amutambula nji, “Wene kame oleyelwe mu sibi no kumanenena, cwale kame wamba nji mbu twiyete?” Mi sebeli amucitela kundee.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oubofu no Mebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Jesu kame ana kuyupa nji namuciti, mi aba ana ku muwana sebeli wamba nji, “Kana kame opumena mwa Mwana no Munu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Omulume sebeli otambula nji, “Mi anyine woyo, Mbumu, nji ni pumene mwa yonyene!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Nu mumono, mi yokame wuyu wamba kwa wene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Omulume woyo sebeli wamba nji, “Kame ni pumena, Mbumu!” Mi sebeli omulapela.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Kakuli ekatulo nina iyele muno mu litunga nji cwale awo no kwamona afanene okumona mane nji awo amona aulwe okumona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Anjili Afalisi ana kwikala ku nyonga ni yonyene aba ana yupa eyi, cwale sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Naaci kame tuli ano kwamona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Nji kambe kame muli eibofu, kambe ka mu kwite ouyi no sibi, kono cwale kame mwamba nji kame tumona, ouyi wenu kwausili.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mulisana no Mikoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, woyo no kwaingena omulaka no mikoko okutusisa omwelo kono kame atina beulu ni ku matukelamo okutusisa endila indina, woyo munu mbuyi ni sisinyi. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Kono woyo oingena okutusisa omwelo yokame omulisana no mikoko. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Kwa yonyene omutateleli no mwelo kame au yatulula, mi emikoko kame iyupa eliywi lyaye, mane nikwisana emikoko yaye ni matina ni kwitwala kundee. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Cwale aba amana oku tundisa emikoko yaye yonje, kame aitwaletela mi emikoko kame imu kon̄a, kakuli kame ilimukile eliywi lyaye. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Mundina kaitamba oku mukon̄a, kono kame sai cilele oku no kuleba ni yonyene, kakuli kaiyii eliywi no andina.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Jesu sebeli waambela enguli eyi, kono kasikuyupisisa eso ana kwamba kwa onyene.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Omulisana no Kuwaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene kame nji, “Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, Time omwelo no mikoko. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Awo onje aneyi oweli kwa mene ambuyi ni isinyi, kono emikoko kaisa yupa. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Time Omwelo. Nji omunu kame aingena okutusisa mene mba yoyisiwa, mane mba ingene ni kubanamo mi mba wana amauyiseto. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Ombuyi kame aiyanga feela mu kwiita, okwibaa ni kusinya. Mene kame nina iyele nji iwane omooyo, mane iuwane mu kupula.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Time omulisana no kuwaba. Omulisana no kuwaba kame aba emikoko yaye omooyo waye. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Kono woyo oli omubeleki mi kasa mulisana, woyo oluwile emikoko no kwatenda eyaye, aba a mona ondiwi yoiya, kame asiya emikoko mi kame acila mane ondiwi kame alema emikoko ni kwihasanya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Omubeleki kame acila ngeeso, kakuli yonyene kame ali omubeleki feela mi kababalele emikoko. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Time omulisana no kuwaba, kame niyii emikoko yange mane emikoko yange kame iniyii.<verse eid="JHN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Kanyi Sitange aba ani limukile, ni mene kame ni limukile Sitange, mi omooyo wange kame niuba emikoko yange. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Cwale kame nikwite emikoko injili eyo kasa ya mu mulaka uno. Kame ni fanena okwilita ngeeso, mi kame seiyupe eliywi lyange, cwale kame sakwikale omutapi mumweya ni mulisana mumweya.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Mulibaka eli Sitange yani singela, kakuli kame nikutoboha omooyo wange, nji ni uwane kame. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Kakwisa omunu woyo soushimba kwa mene. Kono kame nina kutoboha wo mukusinga kwange. Kame nili ni maata no ukutoboha wo mane ni kuushimba kame. Etaelo eyi kame nina itambula okutunda kwa Sitange.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Kame kuna kwikala oukutaba kame mukaci no Majuda mulibaka no maywi aa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Ano kupula mwa onyene sebeli aamba nji, “Jesu kame akwite amadimona mane kame atakana, iikene aba muteeteta kwa yonyene?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Kono anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Amaywi aa kasa omwambelo no munu woyo oli ni madimona. Kana edimona kame itwesa okuyatulula amiyo no sibofu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kaniwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Cwale neli omukiti no kakulo ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Neli omubebo mi Jesu yo enda-enda ba patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe, mu makozwana no mwelo wa Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Cwale Amajuda sebeli akuwana okumu beeka mukaci ni kwamba nji, “Kanako ikuma babine eyo sotu teule mu kwayupisisa? Nji ya wene Kilesite otwambele wino eniti.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Na niku myambela, mi ka mwasi pumena. Emisebezi eyi ni tenda mu litina lya Sitange yokame eyi ini paka. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Kono ka muni pumene, kakuli kamulamata ku mikoko yange. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Emikoko yange kame iyupa eliywi lyange, mi kame ni ilimukile mane kame ini kon̄a, <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>kame niiba omooyo no kwaabwa, mi kaitamba okusinyeha, mane kakwisa omunu so itundisa mu lyoko lyange. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Sitange ona kuniba yo, wa kuneneba okubitelela einu yonje, mi kakwisa omunu so twesa okwitundisa mu lyoko lya Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Mene ni Sitange kame tuli bamweya.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Amajuda sebeli atola amawee kame, nji amukonde oo. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kame ninami monisa emisebezi no kuwaba eyi no kupula eyo itunda kwa Sitange. Ku yonyene emisebezi eyo ubine omusebezi ni ibaelwa?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Amajuda sebeli amutambula nji, “Katuku pwacaulele omusebezi no kuwaba, kono ni mu kunyefula, kakuli wene kame oli omunu mi kame okutenda nji tiwe Nyambe!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kana kaya sikun̄oliwa mu mulawo wenu?, Kame naamba nji, ‘Aanyi emilimu.’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Nji kame ana isana nji milimi, kwanyine oko lina kwiiya eliywi lya Nyambe, (mi aman̄olo ka coliwa.) <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Kame mwamba ya yonyene woyo ona sepiwa kwa Sitange ni kumu tuma mu litunga. Kame mu nyefula kakuli kame nina aamba nji time Omwana Nyambe? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Nji kani tende emisebezi ya Sitange, cwale mulese oku nipumena. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Kono nji kame niitenda, simba nji anyi kamuni pumene, mupumene amaywi awo mufanena oku limuka niku yupisisa nji Sitange kame ali mwa mene mane ni mene mwa Sitange.<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Kame sebeli aeteka okununga Jesu, kono sebeli obanduka mu maoko oo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Jesu sebeli ota kame oka luta okuta mu linjaliya lya Jodani ku sibaka eso ana kwikala Jowani ba weli yo kolobeza mi omo sebeli oka ikalamo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Cwale ano kupula sebeli aiya kwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Jowani kasiku tenda emakazo.” “Kono einu yonje eyo Jowani anaamba okukumanena ni wuyu mulume neli ya niti.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Cwale ano kupula sebeli apumena mwa Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Elifu lya Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikala omulume munjili neli omweti ona kwisanwa Lazalo no Beteni, omundi wa Maliya ni mukulwaye Maleta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Maliya yokame ona kushokona Ombumu amati no sende, ni kumu kuumuna amakondo aye ni tin̄uki taye, Lazalo ona ku toma neli mandaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Cwale amandaye sebeli atuma aanu kwa Jesu okaamba nji, “Mbumu, omusingiwa wowe kame atomine.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Kono Jesu aba ana kuyupa ngeeso sebeli wamba nji, “Ou weeti kasa wa kufa, kono ni wa kuyeema Nyambe, nji cwale Omwana Nyambe ayemiwe mu libaka lyawo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Jesu kame ana kusinga Maleta ni minaye ni Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa nji Lazalo neli omweti, sebeli oekeza okwikala amaywaa ayiili kame mu sibaka omo ana kwikala. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Munyima no eyo Jesu sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, “Twendeni kame mu Judeya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Aiyetwa sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Labbi, Amajuda kame ana kusinga okukukonda amawee, cwale kosinga okuta kuya kame?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kasanji kame kuli etihola likumi ni timbili mu liywaa? Nji omunu kame aenda omunji kasisitala, kakuli kame amona eliseli no litunga lino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Kono omunu aba aenda ousiku kame asitatala, kakuli eliseli ka lisako kwa yonyene.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Aba ana mana okwamba eyo ni kwaambela nji, “Lazalo omulikani wetu nalangana, kono nisita nika mwingule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Aiyetwa sebeli atambula nji, “Mbumu, nji nalangana, mbaikala wino.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Cwale Jesu kame ana kwamba olufu lwaye, kono onyene kame ana ku yambuta nji kame aamba otulo feela. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waataluseta wino nji, “Lazalo nafu, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>mi mulibaka lyenu kame ni wabelelwa aba nina kuulwako, nji mu pumene. Kono cwale twendeni kwa yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Tomasi ona kwisaniwa Mbile sebeli wamba kwa iyetwa nji, “Twendeni naaci, tu kafe naye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Okwinguka mane yo Mooyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kukeela kame ana kuwana nji Lazalo sebeli okwite amaywaa anee yo teulilwe mu liyumbelo. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Cwale Betaniya neli beebi ni Jelusalema omwendo ofanena eibima yiili, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>mi Amajuda no kupula kame ana kwiiya kwa Maleta ni Maliya, muku silisa mulibaka no lifu lya mandoo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Cwale Maleta aba ana kuyupa nji Jesu kame akeile, sebeli ota nukuwana naye, abo Maliya yoikalile mu ndoo. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Maleta sebeli waambela Jesu nji, “Mbumu, kambe na ukwikalako, kambe mandange ka sifa! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Cwale simba bano niyii nji esi sonje so kumbele kwa Nyambe, Nyambe mba kubiso.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mandowe mba inguka kame.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Maleta sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, Nilimukile nji mba inguka kame mu nako no kwinguka ba liywaa no mamaneneno.<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Time omooyo ni kwinguka. Woyo opumena mwa mene, simba afe mba yoyo, <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>mi omunu yonje woyo oyoya mane ni kupumena mwa mene, katamba okufa luli. Kana kame opumena ngeeso?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Maleta sebeli otambula nji, “Ee Mbumu, kame nipumena nji ya wene Kilesite omwana Nyambe, oneyi mu litunga.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Lila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Aba ana kumana okwamba eyo, sebeli ouka oka isana minaye Maliya yo aamba mukondoka nji, “Omwiyeti kwaali bano, mi kame akwisana.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Cwale Maliya osi yupa ngeeso, sebeli oimana wangu ni kuta kwa Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Cwale Jesu yokasi ingena kale mu mundi, kono yosili abo Maleta ana ku muwaniketela. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Cwale Amajuda awo ana kwikala ni Maliya mu ndoo a mongota, aba ana kumona nji kame ana leluba okwimana ni kubanena bandee, sebeli amukon̄a. Kame ana ku yambuta nji kame ata ku liyumbelo oka lila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Cwale Maliya aba ana kukeela oko Jesu ana kwikala, osimu mona feela, sebeli okwela ba makondo aye, yo aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, kambe kona kwikala, kambe mandange ka sikufa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumumona yo lila, ni Majuda amukon̄elele alemine okulila no nyene, sebeli oyaiwa mu mebo ni kusisimuka. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Jesu sebeli oibanguta nji, “Kubine muna mubeeke?” Seli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Molyetu, wiiye omone.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli olila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Cwale Amajuda sebeli aamba nji, “Komumone omo anaku musingela!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Kono anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Yokame wuyu ona kuyatulula amiyo no sibofu no mulume, iikene kasi teula wuyu mulume nji alese okufa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo abana Inguliwa Kwaafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Jesu sebeli oyaiwa kame mu mebo, mi sebeli ota ku libita, neli owina ona kuyatiliwa ni liwee. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Mu tundise eliwee!” Maleta omandaa no mulume onafu, sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mbumu, ba nako ino sebeli onuka, kakuli sebeli amaywaa anee yofile!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ka nisi kwambela nji aba opumena, mbu mono ekanya ya Nyambe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Cwale sebeli atundisa eliwee. Jesu sebeli waliketa amiyo aye ku wilu ni kwamba nji, “Sitange, kame ni kutumela mwa wene, kakuli nuni yupu. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Kame niyii nji kame oni yupa enako yonje, kono kame naamba ngeeso mulibaka no aanu no kupula aa ana nibeke mukaci, nji apumene nji nuni tumu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba ngeeso, sebeli okuwa ni liywi linene nji, “Lazalo, otunde mu liyumbelo!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Omulume ona kufa sebeli obanamo, yo tingetilwe ku makondo ni ku maoko olwambi, mi olubala lwaye olu fukilwe ependeka. Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mu munungutule, mi mumu lesele akwendele.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulelo no Kwibaa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateu26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maleka14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Cwalehe Amajuda no kupula awo ana kwiiya ni Maliya mi sebeli amona eyo ana tende Jesu, sebeli apumena mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Kono anjili kwa onyene, sebeli ata kwa Afalisi mu kwaambela esi ana tende Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Cwale apulisita akulu na Falisi sebeli awaneka aendisi no Keleke ni kwamba nji, “Iikene satutende? Kakuli wuyu mulume kame atenda etimakazo no kupula. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Nji tu muleselele yo tenda ngeeso, aanu onje kame sa pumene mwa yonyene, mi Amaloma kame saiiye mu kushandola esibaka setu no kukena ni sicaba setu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Kono omunjili kwa onyene, Kayafa, omupulisita mukulu mu mwaka owo, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, Kakwisa esi mulimukile! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ka muyupisisa nji kwakuwaba omunu mumweya aba afela aanu, nji cwale esicaba sonje silesele okusinyeha? <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Ka sikwamba feela mukusinga kwaye, kono bakutenda nji neli omupulisita mukulu mu mwaka owo, kame ana kunuha nji Jesu kame sa fele esicaba, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>mi kasa esicaba feela, kono bamweya naana a Nyambe awo ana hasana.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Cwale okutunda ba liywaa elyo, sebeli alela nji a mwibae. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Jesu sebeli olesela okuta yoku monahaza mukaci no Majuda, kono sebeli otundamo oukutela mu naha ina kwikala ku nyonga ni lihalaupa, mu tolopo isaniwa nji Efalaimu, mi sebeli oikalamo na iyetwa aye.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Cwale omukiti no Paseka no Majuda oli beebi, mi ano kupula sebeli atunda mu naha okuta ku Jelusalema okutangeta omukiti no Paseka owakasi tendahala kale nji aka kukenise. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Kame ana kusaelanga Jesu akwambisa omunjili ku munjili aimanine mu patelo no Ndoo ya Nyambe nji, “Kame mu yambuta ngasibine? Ninji katamba okwiiya ku mukiti?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Cwale apulisita akulu na Falisi sebeli alaela nji omunu olimukile omo ali Jesu, kame afanena okwasimweta, nji cwale amununge.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Maliya yo Waa Jesu Amaati mu Beteni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateu26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maleka14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Aba kuna kusiyala amaywaa atanu ni kamweya nji Epaseka itendiwe, Jesu sebeli wiiya ku Beteni, omo ana kwikala Lazalo woyo ona kwingulwa kwaafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Omo sebeli otendelwa omulalelo, Maleta yo sikutaba eilya, mi Lazalo neli mumweya kwa sikulya naye ku tafule. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Maliya sebeli oshimba amaati no sende awo ali elicika mu katele, mane ni kuwaa amakondo a Jesu. Mi sebeli watundisa ni tin̄uki taye. Mi endoo yonje mane sebeli iiyala ni mumwee no maati.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Kono Judasi Isikaliota omunjili no aiyetwa aye woyo so mubeteka, sebeli wamba nji,<verse eid="JHN 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Iikene esende eyo aba ka isiulisiwa emyanda yaatu no muwayawaya, (300) mi amali awo atabelwe awo ashebile?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Kame ana kwamba ngeeso, kasa nji kame ana ku tokomela awo ashebile, kono mulibaka no kutenda nji neli mbuyi yokame ona ku teulanga esikwama no mali, mi kame ano ku shimbelanga eyo ina ku bekiwangwa mo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Mu mulesele yomboci, mu mulesele aateule konji ba liywaa no kepelo yange. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Kakuli awo ashebile kame muli noo enako yonje. Kono ka mutamba okwikala ni mene enako yonje.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Amajuda no kupula aba ana kuyupa nji Jesu mwaali omo mi sebeli aiya, mi kasa mulibaka lya Jesu feela, kono ni mu kumona Lazalo ona kwingulwa kwaafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Apulisita akulu sebeli alela okwibaa ni Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>kakuli Amajuda no kupula kame ana kwa siya mulibaka lya Lazalo, mi sebeli apumena mwa Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Ingena mu Jelusalema mu Umbumu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maleka11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Aba kuna kupa okupula no ku neneba no aanu aa ana kwiiya ku mukiti, aba ana yupa nji Jesu kame aiya mu Jelusalema, sebeli ashimba emitayi no tinzalu.<verse eid="JHN 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Cwale sebeli ashimba emitayi no itondo no tinzalu ni kuta okamu waniketa akuweleza nji, “Hosana! Embuyoti ya woyo wiiya mu litina lya Mbumu, Ombumu no Isilaele!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Mi Jesu sebeli owana akana no mbongolo, sebeli oikala beulu wako kanyi aba kun̄olilwe nji, <verse eid="JHN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Olese kucila, wene Omwana Sione no mukatana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Komone, ombumu wowe okeyile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">yo ikalile beulu no kana no mbongolo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Aiyetwa aye kasi kuyupisisa eyo ba weli, kono Jesu aba ana kumana okukanyisiwa, cwale sebeli apuluka nji eyi kame ina kun̄oliwa eyaye mane namutendele yo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Mi oundi no aanu awo ana kwikala naye aba ana kwisana Lazalo okutunda mu liyumbelo, mi sebeli omwingula kwaafu, kame ana ku mupaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Mi elibaka elyo oundi no aanu aba ana kuta okamuwaniketa, neli nji kame ana kuyupa nji kame anatende emakazo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Afalisi sebeli akwambisa omunjili ku munjili nji, “Mu mone nji ka mutwese okutenda esinjili. Komumone, elitunga lyonje na limukon̄o!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amagelike anjili Asaela Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikala Amagelike anjili kwaa ana kwiiya mu kulapela ku mukiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Seli aiya kwa Filipi na ku Betasaida na mu Galileya, mi sebeli amu kumbela nji, “Molyetu, kame tu singa oku mona Jesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipi sebeli ota nuka ambela Andiliyasi mi cwale Andiliyasi ni Filipi sebeli akambela Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Jesu kame ana kwatambula nji, “Enako naiyi eyo Omwana no munu eyi sa kanyisiwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, embuto no uloto eyi ikunwa mu mumbu aba yulwa okufa, mba ikala yomboci, kono aba ifa, mba iliti eilya no kupula. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Woyo osinga omoyo waye, mba utaukelwe, kono woyo otimbile omoyo waye mu litunga lino, mba tewelwa omoyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Omunu aba ani sebeleza ani kon̄e, mi omu nili, woyo oni sebeleza mba ikala mo ni yonyene mi omunu aba ani sebeleza, Sitange mba mukuteke.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Aamba Eyi no Lifu lyaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Cwale Omoyo wange kame ukalelwe mi iikene sa naambe? ‘Sitange onisileleze mu nako eyi’? Kokuulwa mulibaka eli kame ineyi ba hola ino. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Sitange okanyise elitina lyowe!” Cwale eliywi sebeli litunda ku wilu eli lyaamba nji, “Kame ninalikanyisa mi mbani likanyisa kame.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Cwale oundi no aanu ona kwimananga sebeli oyupa eliywi ni kwamba nji nalilumu, anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Elingeloi na lyamba kwa yonyene!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Eliywi elyo kame lineyi mulibaka lyenu, kasa mulibaka lyange. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Cwale ino ni katulo no litunga lino, cwale ombumu no litunga lino mba citelwe kundee. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Cwale mene aba sani none okutunda ba litunga mba niliti aanu onje kwa mene.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Kame ana kwamba ngeso oku monisa elifu elyo safe. <verse eid="JHN 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Ano kupula sebeli atambula nji, “Kame tuna iyetwa ku mulawo nji Kilesite mba ikala enako yonje. Ngasibine aba wamba nji omwana no munu mba noniwa okutunda ba litunga? Anyine Omwana no Munu?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, Eliseli kwa li sili mwaanyi enako icana fela. Mweende aba mu sili ni liseli, nji ouwi olese oku milema, kakuli woyo weenda mu uwi ka limukile oko ata. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Aba mu sili ni liseli, mu pumene mu liseli, nji mu futuke aana no liseli.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Okwa Pumena no Aanu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jesu osi mana okwamba ngeso, sebeli okutela mi sebeli okushweeka kwa onyene. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Simba nji kame ana kutenda etimakazo no kupula ngeso balubala loo, kono aendisi no Majuda kasi kupumena mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Esi neli okwiyateteta amaywi ana kwambiwa kwa munuhi Isaya, eli lyaamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mbumu, anyine ona pumene etaba yetu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Mi kwanyine oko ku monahalisa elyoko lya Mbumu?” <verse eid="JHN 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Cwalehe kame ana ku kwangwa okupumena, kakuli Isaya na kwamba kame nji,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Nyambe kame ana fofalisa amiyo oo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">mi kame ana tatafalisa emicima yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">nji alese okumona ni miyo oo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">alese okuyupa ni micima yoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">alese oku siulukela kwa mene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nji nabalisa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaya kame ana kwamba eyo kakuli kame ana kumona ekanya yaye, mane sebeli wamba eya Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Simba aba kulingeso, aa no kupula kwa endisi no Majuda anjili kame ana pumene kwa yonyene, kono kasiku kutoya, mu kucila Afalisi nji alese oku citelwa ku ndee no ndoo no milapelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Kakuli kame ana kusinga oku bubekwa kwaanu, okubita oku bubekwa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Jesu sebeli okuweleza nji, “Woyo opumena mwa mene, ka pumene mwa mene, kono kame apumena mwa woyo ona ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Mi woyo oni mona, kame amona ni woyo ona ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Kame ni neyi mu litunga kanyi eliseli nji woyo yonje opumena mwa mene alese okwikala muuwi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Nji omunu kame ayupa amaywi ange, mi yo ulwa okwa teula, mene kani mwatula, kakuli ka ni siiya mu kwatula elitunga, kono nji ni yoyise elitunga. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Woyo oni kana mi yo ka tambula amaywi ange, kame akwite woyo so mu atula, Eliywi ninaamba lyokame elyosa limwatule mu liywaa no mamaneneno! <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Kakuli ka ni kwambele mu maata ange feela, kono Sitange woyo ona ni tumu, yokame ona laele esi ni fanena okwamba, ni mukwa owo naamba nawo. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Mi kame ni yii nji etaelo yaye ni moyo no kwaabwa. Mi cwale esi naamba, kame ni saamba kanyi Sitange aba ana nambele so.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Yowisa Eilyatiso no Aiyetwa aye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Cwale omukiti no Paseka waka sikeela kale, Jesu naku limuka nji enako yaye no kutunda mu litunga okuta kwa sitaye naikwana mukusinga aye awo ana kwikalanga mu litunga, sebeli wasinga okutwala ku mamaneneno.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Cwale enako no kulya omulalelo aba ina kukwana, abo cwale Odiabulozi yo waingena kale mumucima wa Judasi Isikaliota, omwana Simoni, oku mubeteka. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Jesu mu kulimuka nji Sitaye kame ana kubeeka einu yonje mu maoko aye, ni nji kame ana kutunda kwa Nyambe, mi kame auka kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Seli oimana ba mulalelo ni kutubula esikumango saye nabeulu, mane nuku nunga olwambi mu mbunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Seli oitela ameyi ba siwana, mi sebeli otangisa oku yowisa eilyatiso no aiyetwa aye, ni kwa kuumuna ni taulo eyi ano kununga mu mbunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Seli oiya ngeso nikwa Simoni Pitolosi, mi cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, kame oyowisa eilyatiso yange nji?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, Esi ni tenda ka usilimukile bano, kono mbu si yupisisa ku lubala.<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, Ku tamba ku ni yowisa eilyatiso yange. Jesu sebeli omutambula nji sikuyowisa kukwite ekabelo ni mene.<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simoni Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu! kasa eilyatiso yange feela, kono ni maoko ange mane ni mutwi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Woyo yonje ona ku yowo, kasaele okuyowa konji kuilyatiso, olutu lwaye lusikenine lonje. Mi anyi kame mu kenine, kono kasa aanyi moonje.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Kakuli kame ana kulimuka woyo so mu beteka. Ni mulibakelyo aba ana kwamba nji, “Ka mu kenine moonje.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Aba ana kumana okwa yowisa kwilyatiso, sebeli okumanga esikumango saye nabeulu, sebeli oikala ba tafule kame, mi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kana kame mu yupisisa esi nina mitende?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Kame mu ni isana nji Mwiyeti ni Mbumu, mi kame mwamba wino, kakuli ya meene. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Mi cwale nji mene ombumu ni mwiyeti wenu inayowisa eilyatiso yenu, naanyi kame mu fanena ouku yowisa kwilyatiso. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Kakuli kame nina mimonisa omwanda nji mutende omu nina mitendele. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, omubika ka biti Ombumu waye, mi woyo ona tumiwa ka biti woyo ona mutumu. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Nji kame mulimuka einu eyi, namufuyaulwa nji kame muitenda.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Kanaamba anyi moonje, nilimukile aa ninakete, kono elin̄olo kame saliiyatetetwe nji, ‘Woyo ona kulya esinkwa sange nanifutukele.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Kame ni myambela etaba eyi bano abo yakasiiya kale, nji aba saitendahale mupumene nji yameene. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, woyo otambula omunu yonje nituma, kame ana tambula mene, mi woyo otambula mene, kame atambula woyo ona nitumu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo aamba eyi no Kubetekiwa kwaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mateu26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maleka14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba ngeso, sebeli oshupeka mu mucima ni kwambela aiyetwa aye nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, omunjili mwaanyi kame sani beteke.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli akwaliketa, abo kalimukile woyo aamba. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Omunjili kwa iyetwa aye Jowani, woyo ona ku singiwa kwa Jesu yo shendamine ba saali saye. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simoni Pitolosi sebeli omu kobeta nji, “Otwibangutele woyo aamba.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Cwale yonyene sebeli oshendamena ba Saali sa Jesu, sebeli oibanguta nji, Mbumu anyine cwale?<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Woyo sani be esinkwa esi sina cupwiwa mu siwana.” Mi aba ana kumana okusi cupwa, sebeli osiba Judasi omwana Simoni Isikalyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Aba ana kumana oku tambula esinkwa, Satani sebeli oingena mu mucima wa Judasi. Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Esi osinga okutenda, ositende wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Cwale kakwisa simba mumweya ba tafule woyo ona kulimuka elibaka anambele ngeso kwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Anjili kame ana ku yambuta nji, Judasi aba ana kutenda nji yo kame osikuteula esikwama, Jesu kame ana ku mwambela nji, akaule esi tusaela ba mukiti simba nji akabe aa ashebile esinjili. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yonyene aba ana kumana okushimba esinkwa, ababo sebeli otundamo. Mi neli usiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etaelo no Ubya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Judasi aba ana kumana oku bana, Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Cwale Omwana no munu na kanyisiwa, mi mwa yonyene, Nyambe na kanyisiwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Nji Nyambe na kanyisiwa mwa yonyene, Nyambe kame mba kamu kanyisa mwa yonyene, mi mba mu kanyisa ababo. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Anange, mbaniikala naanyi ba nako inyonyo feela. Mba muni saele, mi kanyi omo nina kwambela kwa aendisi no Majuda, kame ni myambela naanyi ngeso, ‘Oko nikatile ka mutwese kuni kon̄a.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Kame ni miba omulawo no ubya, ninji muku singe kanyi omu nina misingele, naanyi muku singe ngeso. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Mweesi aanu onje mbalimuka nji muli aiyetwa ange, nji kame mukusinga omunjili ku munjili.<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Aamba Eyi no Kukana kwa Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoni Pitilosi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu, kubine okatile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jesu sebeli omu tambula nji, “Oko nikatile ka mutwese okunikon̄a cwale, kono munyima mba muni kon̄o.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Mbumu iikene abo kani kukon̄o abano? Mene kame sanife ni wene!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Jesu sebeli omu tambula nji, “Kana kame otwesa okutoboha omoyo wowe kwa mene? Niti luli kame ni kwambela nji, Omukombwe owa kasilila kale, kame sonilatule twaatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Endila ita kwa Sitetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>“Mulese okubilaela mu micima yenu, mupumene mwa Nyambe mane mupumene ni mwa mene ngeso. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Mu ndoo ya Sitange emizuzu ni yakupula, kambe kasa ngeso kambe kanisi myambela ngeso nji kame nikatile oka milukiseta esibaka. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Cwale aba nita oka milukiseta esibaka, mbani uku kame mukumishimbela kwa mene nji mukaikale nange oko nili. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Kame mulimuka endila ita ku sibaka oko nita.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomasi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mbumu, katuyii oko ukatile, cwale ngasibine satu limuke endila itako?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Time endila, ni niti, mane ni moyo, kakwisa omunu sota kwa Sitange konji mwa mene. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Nji namuku nilimuka, kambe namu limuka ngeso ni Sitange, okutunda bano namu mulimuka mane namumu mono.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mbumu, otumonise Sitetu, mi mba tukolwa.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Kame nina ikala naanyi enako no kuleba, mi kausi nilimuka Filipi? Woyo ona nimono kame ana mono ni Sitange. Ngasibine aba wamba nji, ‘Otu monise Sitetu’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Kaupumene nji kame nili mwa Sitange mane ni Sitange kame ali mwa mene? Amaywi awo naamba kwa wene kani myambele oo mu maata ange, kono Sitange woyo oli mwa mene yokame woyo otenda emisebezi yaye. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Mu nipumene nji kame nili mwa Sitange mane Sitange kame ali mwa mene. Nji kasangeso mu nipumene mulibaka no misebezi eyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, “Woyo opumena mwa mene mbatende emisebezi nitenda mane kame sa tende minene niku bitelela, kakuli kame nita kwa Sitange.” <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Eyo yonje okumbela mu litina lyange, kame sani itende nji Sitange akanyisiwe mwa Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Nji kame mukumbela esinjili mu litina lyange, mba nisi tende.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esepiso no Mebo No Kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Nji kame muni singa, mu mamele etitaelo tange. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Cwale mba nilapele Sitange, mi mba mibi omuombaombi omunjili, nji aikale naanyi okuta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Simba Emebo no niti, eyo elitunga ka litwese okwitambula simba okwilimuka kakuli kali imwine, mi kali ilimuka. Kono anyi kame mu muyii, kakuli kame ali naanyi mane mba ikala kwaanyi.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Kani tamba ku misiya memuli andiyala, mba ni uku kwaanyi. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Kusili enakoicana mi elitunga kali tamba oku ni mona kame, kono anyi mbamu nimono. Kakuli mene kame ni yoya, naanyi mba muyoyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Mu liywaa elyo, mba mu limuka nji kame nili mwa Sitange, naanyi kame muli mwa mene mane ni mene mwaanyi.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Woyo oli ni titaelo tange mane nikutiteula, yokame woyo oni singa. Mi woyo oni singa, mba singiwa kwa Sitange ni mene mba nimu singi mane niku monahaze kwa yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Judasi (kasa Isikalioti) sebeli wamba nji, “Mbumu, ngasibine wamba nji mbu kumonahaza kwaaci, mi kasa ku litunga?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Jesu sebeli omutambuta nji, “Omunu aba ani singa, mba mamele eliywi lyange. Mi Sitange mbamu singi, mi mbatwiyi kwa yonyene mane tuyake omundi wetu ni yonyene.” <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Woyo no kwani singa ka teula amaywi ange mi eliywi muyupa kasa lyange kono lya Sitange ona nitumu.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>Einu eyi kame nina myambele yo aba ni sili nenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Kono Omombaombi, Emebo No Kukena eyo Sitange mba itumu mu litina lyange, mba imiiyete einu yonge mane mbaimi pulukisa einu yonje eyo nina myambele.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>Kame nimi siyela ekozo, ekozo yange nimiba, kaikufeke ni omo limibelanga elitunga, omo nimibela. Emicima yenu ilese okukatazeha simba okucila. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Na mukuyupa eyi nina myambele nji, ‘Kame nita, mi mba niiyi kwaanyi.’ Kambe namukunisinga, kambe mbamu wabelelwe kakuli kame nita kwa Sitange, kakuli Sitange wa kuneneba okubita mene. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Cwale kame nina myambele eyo ekaya sitendahala, nji aba imana okwiiya, mu pumene. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Sitamba okwamba eino kupula naanyi, kakuli omubusisi no litunga lino okeyile. Ka kwite amaata beulu yange, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>kono kame nitenda kanyi Sitange omo anani laelele, nji cwale elitunga lilimuke nji kame ni singa Sitange.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Ko mwimane, twendenyi abano.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ebeine no Luli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Time ebeine no niti, mi osi kulima ni Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Omutayi onje uli kwa mene nokwa beeka embuya, kame au temako mi omutayi onje ou ubeeka embuya, kame au kolela nji obeeke onene embuya. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Anyi namu kenisiwa mulibaka no liywi nina myambele kale. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Mwikale mwa mene, kanyi mene aba nili mwaanyi. Kanyi omutayi aba kautwese okubeeka embuya wonyene, konji aba okubeeka mu beine, kame kuli ngeso ni kwaanyi, konji aba samukubeeke mwa mene.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>Time ebeine, anyi kame muli emitayi. Woyo okubeeka mwa mene, ni mene kame nili mwa yonyene, yokame woyo obeeka embuya onene, kakuli nji sisako ka mutwese okutenda esinjili. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Nji omunu kakubeeke mwa mene, kame akoliwa kanyi omutayi ni kukukuta, mi emitayi kame yungekiwa ni kukondelwa mu mulilo mane ni kubya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Nji kame mukubekile mwa mene mane amaywi ange kame ali mwaanyi, mukumbele eso sonje musinga mi mbamu sitendelwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ba kutenda ngeso Sitange mba kanyisiwa nji kame mubeeka onene embuya, mi bokame aba samutende aiyetwa ange. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Kanyi Sitange aba ana nisingi ni mene kame nimi singa ngeso, mu yoye mu lilato lyange. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Nji kame muteula etitaelo tange, kame sa mwikale mu lilato lyange, kanyi aba nina mamele etitaelo ta Sitange mane kame niikalile mu lilato lyaye.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Kame nina myambele eyo nji okuwabelelwa kwange kwikale mwaanyi nji cwale okuwabelelwa kwenu kwiyale. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Etaelo yange ninji muku singe omunjili ku munjili, kanyi aba nina misingi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Kakwisa omunu woyo oli ni lilato no kuneneba okubitelela eli, konji omunu okutoboha omoyo waye mulibaka no alikani aye. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Kame muli alikani ange nji kame mutenda eyo nimi laelela. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Sitamba oku miisana nji muli abika, kakuli omubika ka limuka eso atenda Molyaye. Kono kame nimiisana alikani ange, kakuli kame nina misimwete eyi nina yupu yonje kwa Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Kasa anyi muna nikete, kono time nina mikete ni kumi tuma nji mute mane muka beeke embuya onene. Cwale embuya yenu iikalelele, nji cwale esi sonje samu kumbele kwa Sitange mu litina lyange amibe so. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Esi nimi laela ninji, muku singe omunjili ku munjili.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olutimbo no Litunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>Nji elitunga kame limi timbile, mulimuke nji kame lina tateke okutimba mene oweli ekalya sitimba anyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Kambe kame muli asi litunga, elitunga kame lisinga esi sili salyo. Kono kakuli kasa muli ano litunga, kono kame nina mikete mu litunga, bokame abo elitunga aba limi timbile. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Mu puluke eliywi elyo nina kumyambele nji, ‘Omubika kasa wakuneneba okubitelela Molyaye.’ Nji kame ani yandisa, mba mi yandisa naanyi, nji kame ana mamele eliywi lyange, mba mamele ngeso ni lyenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Kono kame sami tende eyo yonje mulibaka lyange, kakuli kayii woyo ona ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Kambe kani siiya mu kwaambela kambe kakwite esibi, kono cwale kaku tatula ku sibi soo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Woyo onitimbile kame atimbile ngeso ni Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Kambe ka ni sitenda mukaci koo emisebezi eyo kakwisa omunu ona itende, kambe kakwite esibi kono cwale kame ana mono, mane kame atimbile mene bamweya ni Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Neli okwiyateteta eliywi elyo lina kun̄oliwa mu mulawo woo nji, ‘Kame ani timbile feela okuulwile omubonda.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>Kono cwale Omombaombi aba saiye, woyo sani tume kwaanyi okutunda kwa Sitange. Simba Emebo no niti eyo saitunde kwa Sitange kame saibe oupaki kwa mene. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Cwale naanyi mba mwipaka, kakuli namwikala ni mene okutunda ku matatekelo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>Kame nina myambele eyo nji mulese oku sitatala. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Mba mitundisa mu tindoo no milapelo mane enako kame iiya eyo omunu yonje oso miibaa, mba yambuta nji kame abelekela Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Cwale mbami tende einu eyo kakuli kasi limuka Sitange simba mene. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Kono kame nina myambele einu eyi nji cwale enako yoo aba saiye, mba puluka nji kame nina ku myambela einu yoo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Omusebezi no Mebo No Kukena</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Ka nisi myambela einu eyi mu matangiseto, kakuli kame nina kwikala naanyi.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Kono cwale kame nita kwa woyo ona kunituma, mi kakwisa kwaanyi woyo soni ibanguta nji kubine ukatile. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Kono kakuli kame nina myambele einu eyi, elikenyi naliyala mu micima yenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Simbakutendengeso kame nina myambela eniti, kame kumi lukeele aba nita kakuli aba niulwa okuta, Omuombaombi katamba okwiiya kwaanyi. Kono aba nita, mba nimu tumu kwaanyi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Cwale aba saiye, mba kolwisa elitunga mulibaka no sibi, okuluka mane ni katulo. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Okukumanena ni sibi kakuli ka pumene mwa mene, <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>okukumanena ni kuluka kakuli kame nita kwa Sitange, mi kamu tamba kuni mona <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>okukumanena ni katulo, kakuli omubusi no litunga lino na atuliwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>Ni sili neyi no kupula no kumyambela, kono kamu twese okwiyupisisa bano. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Emebo no niti aba saiye, kame sa mi twale mu niti yonje kakuli ka tamba okwambela yonyene, kono mba myambele eyi ana yupu yonje mane ami lemuse neyi isiiya. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Mba nikanyisa, kakuli mba shimbi kweyi ili yange, mi mba myambele yo. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Esi sonje ali naso Sitange sange, cwalehe kame ninaamba nji mba shimbi kwesi sili esange, mi kame sami limukise so.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okweena ni Kuwabelelwa kwa luli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>Kwesili enakoicana, mi ka mu tamba kuni mona, mi kame enakoicana mba muni mono. <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Anjili kwa iyetwa aye sebeli akwambota omunjili ku munjili nji, “Iikene eyi aamba wuyu kwaaci? Nji mu nako icana feela kamutamba kuni mona, mi mu nako icala kame mbamu nimono ni kwamba nji, ‘Kame nita kwa Sitange.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Seli aamba nji iikene aba aamba nji, ‘Mu nako icana feela?’ Katuyii esi atalusa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Jesu muku limuka nji kame asinga okumwibanguta, cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Esi sokame mukwibanguta mukaci kenu nji ‘Mu nako icana feela kamutamba kunimona, mi mu nako icana kame mbamu nimono’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji mba mu lili, mane kame sa mu bokolole, mi elitunga mba linyakalala. Mba mweene, kono okweena kwenu mba kufutuka okuwabelelwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Omukati aba aleya kame akukalelwa, kakuli enako yaye na ikeela, kono aba amana okuleya omwana, ka puluka en̄alelwa yaye, mulibaka no kuwabelelwa nji omwana na leiwa mu litunga. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Naanyi ngeso, kame muli mu likenyi bano, kono mba nimi mono kame emicima yenu mba iwabelelwa. Mi kakwisa omunu so mi byangula okuwabelelwa kwenu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Ba liywaa elyo kamu tamba kuni ibanguta simweya. Niti luli kame ni myambela nji eso sonje sa mukumbele kwa Sitange, mba mibi so mu litina lyange. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Kubitela bano ka mu sikumbela simweya mu Litina lyange. Mu kumbele mi mba musi biwi, nji okuwabelelwa kwenu kutende okuno kwiyala.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okukoma Elitunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Kame nina myambele eyi mu tinguli. Kono enako kame iiya, eyi sa ni lesele okwamba naanyi mu tinguli, ni myambele eniti eyi ya Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Eliywaa elyo, kame sa mu kumbele mu Litina lyange, mi ka naamba nji mbani mi lapelele kwa Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Kakuli Sitange yonyene kame amisinga, kakuli namu nisingi, mi kame muna pumene nji kame nina tundu kwa Sitange. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Kame nina tundu kwa Sitange, mi kame ni neeyi mu litunga kono cwale kame ni siya elitunga okuuka okuta kwa Sitange.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Aiyetwa aye sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Omone, cwale kame wamba wino, kasa okwamba mu tinguli. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Cwale na tu lemuha nji kame ulimuka einu yonje, mi ku saele nji omunu a kwibangute. Mumukwanongeso, kame tu pumena nji kame utunda kwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Cwale bano kame mu pumena? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Enako kame ikeyile, mane naikeela, eyi sa muhasane, munu ni munu ku ndoo yaye mi mba mu ni siyi memboci. Kono ka nili memboci, kakuli Sitange kame ali ni mene. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Kame nina myambele eyo nji mwamene mwikale ni kozo mu micima mulibaka lyange. Kame sa muyandisiwe mu litunga kono mongole emicima, kame nina komo elitunga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kulapelela Yonyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba amaywi awo, sebeli waliketa amiyo aye ku wilu ni kwamba nji, “Sitange, enako naikeela. Okanyise Mwanowe nji Omwana aku kanyise. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Kakuli kame ona mubi amaata beulu no aanu onje, okuba omoyo no kwaabwa kwa woyo yonje ona mubi. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Uno omoyo no kwaabwa, nji aku limuke, wene Nyambe no niti ni Jesu Kilesite woyo ona kutuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Kame ni kukanyisa mu litunga, mukumana omusebezi ona kuniba mu litunga nji ni utende. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Cwale bano Sitange, onikanyise ba lubala lowe ni kanya iya nina kwikala nayo ni weene abo elitunga ekalya sumbiwa kale.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Lapelela Aiyetwa Aye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Kame nina limukisa elitina lyowe kwaanu ona nibi mu litunga. Kame ali kwa wene mi nonibi woo mane na mamele eliywi lyowe, <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>cwale kame alimukile nji esinu sonje eso ona nibi, kame situnda kwa wene. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Kakuli kame ninaabi amaywi ona nibi, mi kame anaa tambula mane na limuka muniti nji kame ninatundu kwa wene, mi na pumene nji kame ona nitumu.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>Kame na lapelela. Silapelele elitunga kono kame nilapelela awo ona nibi, kakuli owe. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Yonje eyo nili nayo yowe, mi yowe yange, mi kame ni kanyisiwa mwa onyene. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Cwale bano silimo mu litunga, kono onyene kame ali mu litunga mi mene kame ni keyile kwa wene. Sitange No Kukena, wateule mu litina lyowe, elyo onanibi wene nji atende amweya kanyi aci. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Abo meni sili noo, kame nina kwateula mu litina lyowe, awo ona kuniba, mi kame nina kwa sileleza mi kwa onyene kakwisa woyo ona tauka, konji woyo anakulimuka nji mbatauka, nji elin̄olo liiyatetetwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Kono bano kame ni iiya kwa wene, mi einu eyi naamba mu litunga, nji cwale aikale ni kuwabelelwa kwange nji iiyatetetwe mwa onyene. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Kame ninaambele eliywi lyowe, mi elitunga kame lyatimbile kakuli onyene kaa ano litunga, kanyi mene aba ka nili osi litunga. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ka niku lapelele nji wa tundise mu litunga, kono nji wa sileleze kwa woyo no kwiiba. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Kasa ano litunga lino, kanyi mene aba ka nili osi litunga. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Wakenise mu niti yowe kakuli eliywi lyowe lyokame eniti. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Kanyi aba ona nitumu mu litunga, cwale ni mene kame ninaa tumu mu litunga. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Mi mulibaka lyoo kame ni kukenisa menyene, nji nonyene abiwe okukenisa mu yonyene eniti.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Lapelela Alupumena Onje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Ka nilapelele onyene feela, kono kame ni lapelela ngeso nawo sa pumene mwa mene mu liywi lyoo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Nji onje atende mumweya, kanyi wene Sitange aba uli kwa mene, ni mene kwa wene. Nonyene ngeso atende mumweya kwaaci, nji elitunga li pumene nji tiwe ona nitumu. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Ekanya eyo ona nibi kame ninaibi kwa onyene nji atende amweya kanyi aci aba tuli mumweya. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Mene, ni ikale kwa onyene, ni wene kwa mene, nji atendiwe asi kupetahala mu umweya, mi elitunga li limuke nji tiwe onani tumu, ninji kame onaa singi kanyi omu ona nisingele.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Sitange, kame ni lakaza nji awo onanibi aikale ni mene omo nili, nji amone ekanya yange eyo onakuniba kakuli kame ona kunisinga elitunga eka lyasitendiwa kale. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Wene Sitange no kuluka! Elitunga kalikuyii, kono mene nikuyii, mi nonyene kame ayii nji nauni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Kame ninaa simwete elitina lyowe, mi mba na simweta lyo, kakuli elilato ona nisingi liikale mwa onyene, mane nimene niikale mwa onyene.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Okunungiwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maleka14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba amaywi aa, sebeli ota naiyetwa aye mu linjaliya no Kasindi no Kediloni, omo kuna kwikala elitema, mi sebeli oingenamo na iyetwa aye. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Cwale Judasi woyo ona kumu beteka, kame ana kulimuka esibaka eso, kakuli Jesu mwana ku kuwanenanga na iyetwa aye aka no kupula. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Cwale Judasi sebeli oshimba esikwata no Masole ni tinumwana eti titunda kwa pulisita akulu nafalisi, sebeli ata mu litema ni tilambi ni mamonyi, mane neyi no kulwisa. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Cwale Jesu muku limuka eso sasi mwiyele, sebeli wiiya kwa onyene ni kwamba nji, “Anyine musaela?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Seli amutambula nji, “Jesu no Nazaleta,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Yamene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judasi, ona kumubeteka, yo imanine noo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Aba ana kwaambela nji , mene uno, sebeli auka ngombemongo, ni kukwela banji. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Jesu sebeli waibanguta kame nji, “Anyine mu saela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Seli aamba nji, “Jesu no Nazaleta.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kame nina myambele nji, yamene uno,” “Nji kame mu saela mene, mu lesele aa alume akutele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Neli nji kwiyatetetwe eliywi eli ana kwamba nji, “Ka nisi taukelwa omunu simba mumweya, kwawo ona nibi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Cwale Simoni Pitolosi ona kulema omukwale, sebeli oushomona ni kuuyaa omubika no mupulisita omukulu, mi sebeli omu patula elitwi no silyo, Omubika woyo kame ana kwisaniwa nji Malukuse. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa Pitolosi nji, “Ouse omukwale mu sipusu sao. Ninji nikwangwe okunwa mu sinweno esi ana nibi Sitange?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoli ba Lubala lwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Cwale esikwata no masole ni mwendisi waso ni tinumwana naendisi no Majuda, sebeli alema Jesu ni kumu nunga, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>mi sebeli amu twala oweli kwa Anasi, kakuli neli njemunwaye Kayafa woyo ona kutendanga omupulisita mukulu mu mwaka owo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayafa yokame ona kweleza aendisi no Majuda nji kame kufanena nji omunu mumweya afela aanu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi yo Kana Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mateu26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maleka14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoni Pitolosi kame ana kukon̄anga Jesu, bamweya ni mwiyetwa munjili. Omwiyetwa woyo kame ana kulimukiwa kwa mupulisita mukulu, cwale sebeli oingena bamweya ni Jesu mu lilapa no mupulisita mukulu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>ababo Pitolosi yo imanine kundee ba mweelo. Cwale omwiyetwa munjili woyo ona kulimukiwa kwa mupulisita mukulu sebeli obanena kundee nukaamba ni mutateleli naba mweelo, mi sebeli oingenyeka Pitolosi mu lilapa. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Cwale omutateleli naba mwelo sebeli wamba kwa Pitolosi nji, “Kana ni wene kame uli omunjili nwaa iyetwa no munu wuyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Pitolosi sebeli otambula nji, “Kokuulwa, kasa mene.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Cwale abika ni tinumwana tina kwikala omo sebeli atumbula omulilo, kakuli kame kuna kombola mi kame ana kwimana ayota omulilo. Ni yonyene Pitolosi na kwikala noo yoimanine okuyota omulilo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omupulisita mukulu yo Ibanguta Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateu26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maleka14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Omupulisita omukulu sebeli oibanguta Jesu mulibaka no aiyetwa aye ni tuto yaye. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kame ninaamba aba no kukena kwaanu, aka no kupula kame nina kwa iyeta mu tindoo no milapelo, omo anaku kuwanenanga Amajuda onje, mi kanasi kwamba esinjili ku nyonga. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Iikene aba oni ibanguta? Oibangute awo ana niyupu esi ninaamba kwa onyene kame ayii eyi naamba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba eyi, omunjili no atateleli ona kwimana abeebi ni yonyene, sebeli omu fula ni lyoko lyaye ni kwamba nji, “Mokame omo otambulela omupulisita mukulu!”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Jesu sebeli omu tambula nji, “Nji kani saamba wino, otaluse eso sinaibi, kono nji kame ninaamba wino, siikene eso oni fulela?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Cwale Anasi sebeli omu tumena kwa Kayafa omupulisita omukulu yo nungilwe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi yo Kana Jesu Kame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mateu26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maleka14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Cwale Simoni Pitolosi yo imanine okututumuna ku mulilo. Seli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kasanji ni wene kame uli omunjili no aiyetwa aye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Pitolosi sebeli okana ni kwamba nji, “Kokuulwa kasa mene.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Omunjili kwabika no mupulisita omukulu, omwabaye woyo ona ku patuliwa elitwi kwa Pitolosi, sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Kanisi ku kumona ni yonyene mu litema?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Pitolosi sebeli okana kame mi ababo, omukombwe sebeli olila.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoli ba Lubala lwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mateu27.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maleka15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Cwale sebeli atundisa Jesu mu ndoo ya Kefasi okumutwala ku kuta, neli amasiku. Kono onyene kasikwingena mu Kuta, nji cwale onyene aulwe ouku silafaza, kono atwese okulya Epaseka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli obanena kwa onyene ni kwaibanguta nji, “Iikene mu mukandimeka wuyu mulume?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Sebeli amutambula nji, “Nji wuyu mulume kasitenda eyi no kwiiba, kambe katusi mulita kwa wene.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilato sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mu mushimbe anyi, mi mu mwatule ni mulawo wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Aendisi no Majuda sebeli amu tambula nji, “Kasa etukelo yetu nji twibae omunu.” (<verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Esi neli okwiyateteta eliywi elyo ana kwamba Jesu okumonisa elifu safe.)<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli oingena mu Kuta kame ni kwisana Jesu ni kumwibanguta nji, “Tiwe Ombumu no Majuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kana kame okwambela feela mu maata owe nji anjili onakwambele yo mulibaka lyange?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilato sebeli otambula nji, “Kana mene kame nili Omujuda? Aanu owe napulisita akulu kame ana kuliti kwa mene. Iikene ona tende?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Omubuso wange kasa no litunga lino, kambe omubuso wange neli ouno litunga lino, kambe abika ange kame alwa ni kuulwa kuniba kwa endisi no Majuda. Kono cwale omubuso wange kasa wa litunga lino!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilato sebeli oibanguta Jesu nji, “Kame uli Ombumu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Kame wamba nji kame nili Ombumu. Sokame esi nina leyelwe, mane sokame nina iyele mu litunga nji nipake eniti. Omunu yonje woyo oli no niti kame ayupa eliywi lyange.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilato sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Cwale eniti niikene?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jesu yo Atulelwa Elifu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mateu27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maleka15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Munyima no kwamba eyi sebeli obanena kame ku Majuda ni kwaambela nji, “Kani siwana omubonda mwa yonyene. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Kono kame muli ni sizo senu nji kame nifanena okumi lukulwela omunu mumweya ba Paseka. Kame muni pumena nji nimi lukulwele Ombumu no Majuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Cwale sebeli akuwa kame nji, “Kokuulwa kasa wuyu mulume! Kono Banabasi!” Mi abo Banabasi neli sisinyi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli oshimba Jesu ni kumushapa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Mi amasole sebeli atinga en̄ata no myunguya ikufekile kanyi omushukwe ni kwibeeka ku mutwi wa Jesu mane sebeli amufuka esikumango no undilu <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>cwale sebeli asheteta kwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Yoosho, Ombumu no Majuda!” Mi alemine oku mufula ni maoko oo.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilato sebeli obana kame ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Komumone kame ni mulita kwaanyi cwale mulimuke nji kanisiwana omubonda mwa yonyene.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli obana, yo ku fukile omushukwe no myunguya, ni sikumango no undilu. Pilato sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Komumone wuyu munu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Cwale apulisita akulu naanu oo, aba ana kumumona, sebeli akuwa nji, “Omungongotele! Omungongotele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mu mushimbe anyi, mi mumu ngongotele, kakuli kani siwana omubonda mwa yonyene.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Aendisi no Majuda sebeli amu tambula nji, “Kame tuli ni mulawo, mi mu mulawo wetu kame afanena okufa, kakuli kame ana kwamba nji Mwana Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Cwale Pilato aba ana kuyupa amaywi awo, sebeli ocila onene. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Seli oingena kame mu Kuta, mi sebeli oibanguta Jesu nji, “Kubine uka tundile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Kono Jesu kasiku mutambula. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilato sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Iikene aba ka wamba nange? Ka uyii nji kame nili ni maata no kuku lukulula, ni maata no kuku ngongotela ba sifapano.”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Kaukwite amaata beulu yange konji na wabiwi okutunda ku wilu, cwalehe woyo ona kubi mene kwa wene yokwite esibi no kuneneba.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Mukuyupa amaywi awo, Pilato sebeli osinga oku mulukulula. Kono aendisi no Majuda sebeli akuwa nji, “Nji kame omu lukulula, kau sepahala kwa Sesale kakuli omunu yonje aba akutenda Oumbumu, kame alwisa Sesale!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Cwale Pilato aba ana kuyupa amaywi aa, sebeli otwala Jesu kundee, ni kwikala ba sipula no katulo, mu sibaka si isaniwa nji “Liwee limakilwe.” Mi mu Sihebelu kame italusa nji “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Cwale neli eliywaa no ukutukiseta Epaseka, mi kame ina ku singa okutenda enako no kamwii luli likumi ni twiili, (12 okuloko). Mi Pilato sebeli wamba kwa endisi no Majuda nji, “Komumone, Ombumu wenu uno!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Kono onyene kame ana kukuwa, nji, “Atwaliwe! Atwaliwe! Omungongotele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ni ngongotele Ombumu wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Kono apulisita akulu sebeli atambula nji, “Ka tukwite Ombumu mundina, konji Sesale!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli waaba Jesu nji angongoteliwe ba sifapano.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Jesu aba ana Kungongoteliwa ba Sifapano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Mi sebeli ashimba Jesu, ni kuta naye. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Cwale sebeli ashimba Jesu ni kushimbisa esifapano saye nikuta ku sibaka siisaniwa nji Katendele, eso siisaniwa nji Gologota mu Sihebelu. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Abo sebeli amu ngongotela ba sifapano, nanjili ayiili, omunjili kweeli elineku, omunjili kweeli elineku, Jesu yoli mukaci koo. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilato sebeli on̄ola elin̄olo no kulimukisa ni kulituleka ba sifapano. Kame kuna kun̄oliwa nji, “Jesu no Nazaleta, Ombumu no Majuda.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Amajuda no kupula sebeli abala beulu no sifapano abo, kakuli esibaka ana ku ngongotelwa Jesu ba sifapano, kame sina kwikala abeebi ni mulenen̄i. Beulu kame kuna kun̄oliwa mu Sihebelu, mu Siloma, ni mu Singelike. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Apulisita akulu no Majuda sebeli aiya mu kwambela Pilato nji, “Olese okun̄ola nji, ‘Ombumu no Majuda,’ kono on̄ole nji, ‘Yonyene ona kukwamba nji, Time Ombumu no Majuda.’”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilato sebeli otambula nji, “Esi nina n̄olo, na si n̄oliwa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Cwale amasole aba ana kumana oku ngongotela Jesu ba sifapano, sebeli ashimba eikumango yaye, sebeli aitaba etikalulo tinee, nji omunjili ni munjili aikale ni saye. Seli ashimba ni sonyene esikumango na kunji kono esikumango eso kasi sikwikala ni mapeka, kame sina kutungiwa ngeso esinu simweya feela. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Seli akwambota mukaci koo nji, “Tulese okusikaula, kono tusi shebuluke, tu limuke nji kame sa sitende sa nyine.” Neli nji kutendahale esi sinambiwa mu lin̄olo nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Sebeli akutabela eikumango yange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">mi kame ashebuluka esikumango sange.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Sokame ana tende Amasole.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Cwale abeebi ni sifapano sa Jesu kame kuna kwikala Inawaye ni minaye Inawaye, Maliya, omoywa Kulopasi, ni Maliya Magadalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Jesu aba ana kumona Inawaye, ni mwiyetwa ana kusinga, aimanine abeebi ni yonyene, sebeli wamba kwa Inawaye nji, “Mukati, omone mwanowe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa mwiyetwa nji, “Komone, Inaowe.” Mi okutunda abo, omwiyetwa sebeli omu twala ku lilapa lyaye.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elifu lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:5-56">Mateu27.5-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maleka15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Eyo aba ina kubwa, Jesu ba kulimuka nji einu yonje na ipetahala, sebeli wamba nji, elin̄olo liiyatetetwe “Kame nifile elinyotwa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Kame kuna kwikala esindunga sina kwiyala ebenega omo, cwale sebeli abeeka esiponji sina bekiwa mu benega niku sishomeka ku lunupa no hisopa, mi sebeli asi sheeteta ku kanwa kaye. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumana okunwa ebenega sebeli wamba nji, “Na kubu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Cwale sebeli okobeka omutwi mane niku kuba Emebo yaye.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Yaiwa Embiinji ku Lubaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Kakuli neli eliywaa no Ukutukiseta omukiti no Paseka. Amajuda kasikusinga nji olutu lwikale ba sifapano ba liywaa no Pumulo kakuli Epumulo eyo neli eliywaa no utokwa onene, cwale aendisi no Majuda sebeli akumbela Pilato nji amakondo nwawo ali ba sifapano simba acoka mi mane kame atwesiwa okushimbiwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Cwale amasole sebeli aiya nikucola amakondo no munu no weli ni wuyu no wiili awo ana kungongoteliwa ni Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Kono aba ana kukeela kwa Jesu, sebeli amona nji nafu, kasi kucola amakondo aye. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Kono omunjili no masole sebeli omuyaa ku lubaci ni mbiinji, mi mu wangu sebeli otunda ounyinga ni meyi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Mi woyo ona mono eyo ni paki, mi oupaki waye niwa niti, mi kame ayii nji kame aamba eyi no niti, nji naanyi mu pumene. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Kakuli einu eyi naitendahala nji elin̄olo liiyatetetwe, eli lyaamba nji, “Kakwisa esifuba saye sasi coliwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Kame elin̄olo linjili kame lyamba nji, “Mba mono woyo ana yaa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okupumbekiwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maleka15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Aba ku nakubwa eyi, Josefa no Alimateya omwiyetwa wa Jesu, kono kunyonga mukucila aendisi no Majuda sebeli okumbela Pilato nji ashimbe olutu lwa Jesu. Mi Pilato sebeli opumena okushimba olutu lwa Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nekudemasi niyonyene ona kwiiya oweli ousiku kwa Jesu, sebeli oiya okulita milasi ni aloye inakuwanekiwa , inakukwana owima ukuma ba mwanda no tipondo. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Seli ashimba esitupu sa Jesu, ni kusipungela mu lwambi bamweya neyo ina kuwanekiwa, mu mukwa no sizo no Majuda owo anakupumbeka nawo afu. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Mi mu sibaka ana ku ngongoteliwa kame kuna kwikala elitema, mi mu litema elyo kame kuna kwikala eliyumbelo no ubya, omo mu na kuulwa okupumbeka mo kale omunu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Cwale kakuli neli eliywaa no Majuda no Ukutukiseta omukiti no Paseka, mi kakuli eliyumbelo kame lina kwikala abeebi, sebeli apumbekamo Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Eliyumbelo muulwile Esinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mateu28.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maleka16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Cwale ba liywaa no weli mu sunda, Maliya Magadalena sebeli omenekela ku liyumbelo kusiilolile mi sebeli omona nji eliwee na litundisiwa ba liyumbelo. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Cwale sebeli oitukela kwa Simoni Pitolosi ni ku mwiyetwa woyo ona ku singiwa kwa Jesu, ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame ana tundisa Ombumu mu liyumbelo, mi katuyii oko ana mubeeke!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli oimana ni mwiyetwa omunjili mi bamweya sebeli ata ku liyumbelo. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Kame ana kwituka onje ayiili, kono omwiyetwa omunjili sebeli oituka okusiya Pitolosi, mane nukakeela oweli ku liyumbelo. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Cwale sebeli onangelamo nikumona etinyambi ti bekilwe banji, kono kasi kwingena mo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Cwale Simoni Pitolosi sebeli okeela ona kumukon̄a, mi sebeli oingena mu liyumbelo. Seli omona etinyambi tibekilwe banji, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>ni lwambi luna kumufuka ku mutwi. Kono lonyene kalusi kubekiwa bamweya ni tinjili, kono lonyene kalu sikuwanekiwa ni tinyambi tinjili kono kame luna kupungiwa lomboci, olu bekilwe kunyonga. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Cwale omwiyetwa omunjili ona kutateka okakeela ku liyumbelo, sebeli oingena ni yonyene mane nikumona, mi sebeli opumena. (<verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Kakuli kasi kuyupisisa kale elin̄olo eli lyamba nji Jesu kame ana kufanena okwinguka kwaafu.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Cwale aiyetwa awo, sebeli aukela ku mindi yoo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kumonahaza kwa Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateu28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maleka16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Kono Maliya sebeli oimana yo lila kundee no liyumbelo. Mi yolila sebeli obama ni kwaliketa mu liyumbelo <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>ni kumona amangeloi ayiili akufukile eyi no likena, aikalile omo ana kulangeka olutu lwa Jesu, elinjili ku mutwi elinjili kwilyatiso. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Mi sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Mukati iikene olila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Yonyene sebeli otambula nji, “Kakuli kame anashimbi Ombumu wange, mi kani yii omo ana mubeeke!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Osamba ngeso sebeli okutemuna ni kumona Jesu yo imanine, kono kasi kulimuka nji neli Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Jesu sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Mukati, iikene olila?” “Anyine osaela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Yonyene ba kuyambuta nji niosi kulima elitema, sebeli wamba nji, “Molyange, nji wene ona mushimbimo, onambele omo ona mubeeke nika mushimbe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Maliya!” Yonyene sebeli okutemuna ni kwamba kwa yonyene mu Sihebelu nji, “Labboni!” (Okutalusa nji, “Mwiyeti”.)<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Olese okunilema,” “Kakuli kani siuka kale kwa Sitange. Kono ote kwa singiwa ange okaambele nji, kame nita kwa Sitange yonyene Sitenu, kwa Nyambe wange yonyene Nyambe wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Maliya Magadalena sebeli ota nuka simweta aiyetwa nji kame ninamono Ombumu, ni kwaambela nji kame ana mwambele einu eyi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kumonahaza kwa Iyetwa aye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maleka16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Ba mangolwaa no liywaa elyo, eliywaa no matatekelo mu sunda emyelo eyi pakilwe omo ana kwikala aiyetwa okucila aendisi no Majuda, Jesu sebeli oiya mukwimana mukaci koo ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Ekozo ikale naanyi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Jesu aba ana kumana okwamba ngeso, sebeli waamonisa amaoko ni lubaci lwaye. Cwale aiyetwa sebeli awabelelwa onene aba ana kumona Ombumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene kame nji, “Ekozo ikale naanyi. Kanyi omu ana ni tumene Sitange, ni mene kame ni mituma ngeso.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba eyi, sebeli waoyelela beulu yoo mane nikwamba kwa onyene nji, “Mu tambule Emebo No Kukena. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Nji kame sa mulemene eibi no munu yonje, kame sa ilemenwe, nji kamwa lemene eibi yoo, katamba okwilemenwa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Tomasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Cwale Tomasi omunjili no kukwana likumi nayiili, (wisaniwa nji Mbile) ka sikwikala nonyene Jesu aba ana kwiiya. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Cwale anjili aiyetwa sebeli amwambela nji, “Na tumono Ombumu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Kono Tomasi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Konji aba sani mone mu maoko aye omo kunakuyaa esipikili mane nibeekemo omunwe wange mu lin̄iba muna kuyaa esipikili ni kulema amaoko ange ku lubaci lwaye, kani tamba kupumena.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Munyima no maywaa atanu ni aatu (8) aiyetwa aye aali kame mu ndoo ni Tomasi yoikalile noo. Emyeelo eipakilwe, kono Jesu sebeli okeela ni kwimana mukaci koo ni kwamba nji, “Ekozo ikale naanyi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa Tomasi nji, “Obeeke omunwe owe muno, omone ni maoko ange oshimbe amaoko owe obeeke ku lubaci lwange cwale olese oku tenda wuyu no kwapumena, kono opumene!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomasi sebeli otambula nji, “Ombumu wange, ni Nyambe wange!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Nupumene kakuli nu nimono? Embuyoti yawo ana pumene naba kasi mona!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuso no Buka Eyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Cwale Jesu natende etimakazo no kupula balubala no aiyetwa, eyo kaisi n̄oliwa mu buka eyi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Kono eyi nai n̄oliwa nji mupumene nji Jesu yokame Kilesite, Omwana Nyambe, mi cwale okupumena kwenu mwikale ni moyo mu litina lyaye.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Kumonahaza kwa Iyetwa aye Atanu nayiili (7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Munyima no eyi, Jesu sebeli oku monahaza kame kwa iyetwa aye, kunyonga no lisa no Tibeliya mi sebeli oku monahaza mu mukwa ou. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoni Pitolosi, Tomasi woyo ona kwisaniwa nji Mbile, Natanaele na mu Kana no Galileya, naana a Zebediya, na njili ayiili no aiyetwa aye kame ano kuwana. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoni Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame nita mu kuyamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Seli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Naaci kame tuta niwene.” Seli ata mane nukaku longa mu wato, kono ousiku owo kasi kuuya esinjili. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Aba kuna kupatalala, Jesu sebeli oimana ba likamba, kono aiyetwa kasi kulimuka nji neli Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Jesu sebeli waaibanguta nji, “Anukana, kamu kwite ondi simba mumweya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Seli amu tambula nji, “Ka kwisa.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Muyambe akanyandi ku lineku no silyo no wato, mi mba muwana esinjili.” Seli ayamba, mi sebeli akwangwa okuyambula akanyandi, mulibaka no tindi okupula.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Cwale omwiyetwa woyo ona kusingiwa kwa Jesu, sebeli wamba kwa Pitolosi nji, “Mbumu wuyu!” Cwale Simoni Pitolosi aba ana kuyupa nji Mbumu wuyu, sebeli okufuka esikumango saye kakuli kame ana kutundisa yo sebeza, ni kumatukela mu liwate. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Kono aiyetwa anjili sebeli aiya ni wato alemine okuyambula akanyandi akaiyalile etindi. Kakuli kame ana kwikala abeebi kanyonyo ni likamba, neli amatambo no kukwana omwanda mumweya. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okufuweka owato ba likamba, sebeli amona amakala no mulilo abo ni ndi yoboniwabo ni sinkwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mu lite ku tindi eti muna uyu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simoni Pitolosi sebeli oingena mu wato nikukokela akanyandi ku likamba aka kaneyala etindi no kuneneba eti tina kukwana omwanda mumweya ni makumi atanu ni twaatu (153) cwale simba nji etindi kame tina kupula ngeso, akanyandi kaka sikukauka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mwiiye mulye.” Mi kwa iyetwa ka kwisa wuyu ona kongola oku mwibangute nji, “Tiwe anyine?” Kakuli kame ana kulimuka nji Mbumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshetetako, ni kushimba esinkwa mane bamweya ni ndi mi sebeli waaba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Aka cwale neli aka no waatu ako ana kukumonhaza kwa iyetwa munyima no kwingulwa kwaafu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okusuka, Jesu sebeli oibanguta Simoni Pitolosi nji, “Simoni Omwana Jowani, kana kame oni singa okubita aa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Seli otambula nji, “Ee Mbumu, kame uyii nji kame niku singa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Olise otwana no mikoko yange.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Jesu sebeli omwibanguta kame aka no wiili nji, “Simoni mwana Jowani kana kame oni singa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Seli omu tambula nji, “Ee, Mbumu, kame uyii nji kame niku singa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Olise emikoko yange.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Jesu sebeli omwibanguta kame aka no waatu nji, “Simoni mwana Jowani, kana kame oni singa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pitolosi sebeli weena, kakuli Jesu kame ana ku mwibanguta emyendo yaatu nji, “Kana kame uni singa?” Mi Simoni sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mbumu kame uyii einu yonje, kame olimukile nji kame niku singa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, ‘Olele emikoko yange.’ <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Niti luli kame ni kwambela nji, “Aba ona kwikala osili wuyu no ubya, kame onoku nunga olukanda wenyene, kame ono kwendelanga omu osingela, kono aba so kulubale, kame so olole amaoko, mi omunjili kame sa kununge olukanda, mi kame sa kutwale oko wasingi.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Jesu kame ana kwamba ngeso okumonisa Pitolosi elifu safe okukanyisa Nyambe. Munyima no eyi sebeli wamba kwa Pitolosi nji, “Onikon̄e!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ni Mwiyetwa Woyo Ona Kusingiwa onene kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Pitolosi sebeli okutemuna, nikumona omwiyetwa ona ku singiwa kwa Jesu ywakon̄a, woyo ona ku shendamena ba saali sa Jesu mu nako no mulalelo, mi yokame woyo onakumwibanguta nji, “Mbumu, anyine woyo so kubeteka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Cwale Pitolosi aba ana ku mumona, sebeli oibanguta Jesu nji, “Mbumu, ngasibine sakwikale kwa wuyu mulume?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Nji kame nisinga nji asiyale okutwala abo sanikaiyele, kwa wene iikene siliko? Onikon̄e!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Cwale elibubo sebeli lihasana mu sicaba nji omwiyetwa wuyu katamba okufa. Kono Jesu kasi kumwambela nji katamba okufa. Kono nji nisinge nji aikale okutwala aba sa nikeyele, cwale eso siikene kwa wene?<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Wuyu yokame omwiyetwa woyo opaka etitaba eti, mi yokame ona tin̄olo mi kame tuyii nji oupaki waye niwa niti.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Kono kweeli einu injili no kupula eyo ana kutenda Jesu. Kambe yonje nai kun̄oliwa kame nisepa nji elitunga kalitwese okuteula eyo ina n̄oliwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
